  <para style="h">2 Saamuʼeel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Saamuʼeel Lammaffaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Saamuʼeel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitaaba</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Saamuʼeel</para>
  <para style="mt3">Lammaffaa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Daawud Akka Saaʼol Duʼe Dhagaʼe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 1:4-12">1:4‑12</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1Sm 31:1‑13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1Sn 10:1‑12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Saaʼol erga duʼee booddee, Daawud Amaaleqoota rukutuu irraa deebiʼee Siiqlaag keessa guyyaa lama ture. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Guyyaa sadaffaatti namichi tokko qubata Saaʼolii dhufe; innis wayyaa isaa tarsaasee mataa isaatti awwaara firfirfatee ture. Yommuu Daawud bira gaʼettis ulfina isaaf kennuuf jedhee addaan lafatti gombifame.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daawudis, “Ati eessaa dhufte?” jedhee isa gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Namichi immoo, “Ani qubata Israaʼelootaa keessaan baqadhee dhufe” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daawudis, “Maaltu dhalate? Mee natti himi” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Innis, “Namoonni adda waraanaatii ni baqatan. Baayʼeen isaanii harcaʼaniiru; duʼaniirus. Saaʼolii fi ilmi isaa Yoonaataanis duʼaniiru” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Kana irratti Daawud dargaggeessa oduu kana fideen, “Akka Saaʼolii fi ilmi isaa Yoonaataan duʼan ati akkamitti beekte?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Dargaggeessi sunis akkana jedhee deebise; “Akkuma tasaa ani Tulluu Gilboʼaatti ol baʼeen ture; Saaʼolis eeboo isaatti irkatee achi ture; gaariiwwan lolaatii fi abbootiin fardaa isa bira gaʼan. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Innis yommuu garagalee na argetti na waame; anis, ‘Maal siif ajajamu?’ jedhee isa gaafadhe.<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />“Innis, ‘Ati eenyu?’ jedhee na gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Ani immoo, ‘Ani nama Amaaleq’ jedheen deebise.<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Ergasiis inni, ‘Narra dhaabadhuu na ajjeesi! Waan lubbuun na keessaa hin baʼiniif ani akka malee dhiphachaan jiraatii’ naan jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Kanaafuu ani sababiin akka inni erga kufee hin fayyine beekeef isa irra dhaabadheen isa ajjeese. Gonfoo mataa isaatii fi bitawoo harka isaa fuudhee gooftaa kootiif fideera.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daawudii fi namoonni isa wajjin turan hundi wayyaa of irraa baasanii tatarsaasan. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Isaanis Saaʼolii fi Yoonaataaniif, loltoota Rabbii Allaahatii fi mana Israaʼel hundaaf gaddanii ni booʼan; hamma galgalaatti ni sooman; isaan goraadeedhaan dhumaniiruutii.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daawudis, “Ati eessaa dhufte?” jedhee dargaggeessicha oduu fide sana gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Innis, “Ani ilma Amaaleq, namicha galtuu taʼe tokkoo ti” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daawud immoo, “Yoos ati dibamaa Rabbii Allaah tokko galaafachuuf harka kee ol fudhachuu maaliif hin sodaatin ree?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ergasii Daawud namoota isaa keessaa tokko waamee, “Dhaqiitii dhaʼii isa ajjeesi!” jedhe. Innis isa dhaʼe; namichis ni duʼe. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daawudis, “Sababii afaanumti kee, ‘Ani nama Rabbii Allaahan isa dibe ajjeeseera’ jedhee dhugaa sitti baʼeef dhiigni kee matuma keetti deebiʼa” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Daawud Saaʼolii fi Yoonaataaniif Faarse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daawud faaruu kanaan Saaʼolii fi ilma Saaʼol Yoonaataaniif booʼe; <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />akkasumas faaruu iddaa jedhamu kana akka namoonni Yihuudaa barsiifaman ajaje; kunis kitaaba Yaashaar keessatti barreeffameera. Innis:<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Yaa Israaʼel, ulfinni kee gaarran kee irratti ajjeefameera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Namoonni jajjaboon akkamitti akkas kukkufan!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Waan kana Gaati keessatti hin dubbatinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">daandiiwwan Ashqaloon irrattis hin labsinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">yoo kanaa achii intallan Filisxeemotaa ni gammadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">intallan warra dhagna hin qabatiniis ni ililchu.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Yaa tulluuwwan Gilboʼaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">fixeensi isin irra hin buʼin yookaan bokkaan isinitti hin roobin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">yookaan lafti qotiisaa midhaan aarsaaf dhiʼeeffamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">biqilchu isin keessatti hin argamin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Gaachanni nama jabaa achitti xuraaʼeeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">gaachanni Saaʼol siʼachi zayitii hin dibamu.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />“Dhiiga namoota dhumanii keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">foon namoota jajjaboo irraa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">iddaan Yoonaataan duubatti hin deebine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">goraadeen Saaʼolis akkasumaan hin deebine.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Saaʼolii fi Yoonaataan yeroo lubbuun jiraachaa turanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">jaallatamoo namni isaanitti gammadu turan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">isaan yeroo duʼaattis gargari hin baane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Isaan risaa caalaa ariifatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">leenca caalaas jabaatu turan.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Yaa intallan Israaʼel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">Saaʼol isa wayyaa bildiimaa fi uffata haphii isinitti uffise,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">kan wayyaa keessan warqeedhaan miidhagse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">sanaaf booʼaa.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Namoonni jajjaboon akkamitti waraana keessatti kufu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yoonaataan gaarran keessan irratti ajjeefameera.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Yaa Yoonaataan obboleessa ko, ani siif gaddeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ati anaaf nama akka malee jaallatamaa turte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Jaalalli ati naaf qabdu dinqisiisaa ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">jaalala dubartii caalaa dinqisiisaa ture.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Namoonni jajjaboon akkamitti kufan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Miʼoonni lolaa balleeffamaniiru!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Daawud Dibamee Mootii Yihuudaa Taʼe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Kana booddee Daawud, “Magaalaawwan Yihuudaa keessaa gara isa tokkootti ol baʼuu?” jedhee Rabbii Allaah gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Rabbii Allaahanis, “Baʼi” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Daawud immoo, “Gara isa kamiittin ol baʼa?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Rabbii Allaahanis, “Gara Kebroonitti” jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Kanaafuu Daawud niitota isaa lamaan jechuunis Ahiinooʼam Yizriʼeelittii sanaa fi Abiigayiil kan Naabaal namichi Qarmeloos sun irraa duʼe wajjin ol baʼe. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Daawud namoota isa wajjin turan tokkoo tokkoo isaanii maatii isaanii wajjin fudhate; isaanis magaalaawwan Kebroon keessa qubatan. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Ergasiis namoonni Yihuudaa gara Kebroon dhufanii mana Yihuudaa irratti Daawudin mootii godhanii diban.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Yeroo akka namoonni Yaabeesh Giliʼaad Saaʼolin qabbaran Daawuditti himametti, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />inni akkana jedhee gara namoota Yaabeesh Giliʼaaditti ergamoota erge; “Sababii isin isa qabbaruudhaan Saaʼol gooftaa keessaniif arjummaa akkasii gootaniif Rabbii Allaahan isin haa eebbisu. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Ammas Rabbii Allaahan jaalala isaa kan hin geeddaramnee fi amanamummaa isaa isiniif haa kennu; ani waan isin akkas gootaniif akkasuma waan gaarii isiniif nan godha. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Egaa amma jabaadhaa; cimaa; Saaʼol gooftaan keessan duʼeeraatii; namoonni Yihuudaa immoo mootii godhatanii of irratti na dibaniiru.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waraana Mana Daawudii fi Mana Saaʼol Gidduu Ture</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 3:2-5">3:2‑5</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 3:1-4">1Sn 3:1‑4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Yeroo sanatti Abneer ilmi Neer ajajaan waraanaa Saaʼol Iish-Booshet ilma Saaʼol fuudhee gara Mahanayiimitti dabarse. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Innis Giliʼaad, Ashuur, Yizriʼeel, Efreemii fi Biniyaam, akkasumas guutummaa Israaʼel irratti isa moosise.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Iish-Booshet ilmi Saaʼol yeroo Israaʼel irratti mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa afurtama ture; innis waggaa lama moʼe. Taʼus manni Yihuudaa Daawud duukaa buʼe. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daawudis Kebroonitti mana Yihuudaa irratti waggaa torbaa fi jiʼa jaʼa mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abneer ilmi Neer namoota Iish-Booshet ilma Saaʼol sana wajjin Mahanayiimii kaʼanii gara Gibeʼoon dhaqan. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yooʼaab ilmi Zeruuyaa fi namoonni Daawud isaan simachuuf baʼanii haroo Gibeʼoon biratti itti dhufan. Gareen tokko gama tokkoon, gareen kaan immoo gama kaaniin haroo sana bira tataaʼan.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abneeris Yooʼaabiin, “Mee dargaggoonni kaʼanii fuula keenya duratti wal haa tuman” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yooʼaabis, “Haa taʼu; wal haa tuman” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Kanaafuu Biniyaam irraa namoonni kudha lama Iish-Booshet ilma Saaʼoliif, namoonni kudha lama immoo kaʼanii Daawudiif lakkaaʼaman. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Tokkoon tokkoon namaas mormituu isaa mataa qabee cinaacha isaatti goraadee diree wal qabatanii kukkufan. Kanaafuu iddoon sun Gibeʼoon keessatti lafa goraadee jedhamee waamame.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Lolli gaafa sanaa akka malee jabaa ture; Abneerii fi namoonni Israaʼelis namoota Daawudiin moʼataman.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Ilmaan Zeruuyaa sadan jechuunis Yooʼaab, Abiishaayii fi Asaaheel achi turan. Asaaheel akkuma kuruphee bosonaa fiigichatti nama jabaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Innis utuu mirgatti yookaan bitaatti hin gorin faana buʼee Abneerin ariʼe. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abneeris of irra garagalee, “Ati Asaaheelii?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Innis, “Eeyyee anuma” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ergasiis Abneer, “Gara mirgaatti yookaan bitaatti garagaliitii dargaggeessa tokko qabii miʼa lolaa isaa irraa fudhadhu” jedheen. Asaaheel garuu isa ariʼuu hin dhiifne.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abneer ammas Asaaheelin, “Na hin ariʼin! Ani maaliifan si galaafadha? Ani akkamittin fuula koo ol fudhadhee obboleessa kee Yooʼaabin ilaala?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Asaaheel garuu isa ariʼuu hin dhiifne; kanaafuu Abneer qara eeboo isaatiin garaa isaa waraane; eeboon sunis keessa fullaʼee dugda isaatiin baʼe. Asaaheelis achitti kufee yommuu suma duʼe. Namni hundis iddoo Asaaheel itti kufee duʼe sana gaʼee dhaabata ture.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Yooʼaabii fi Abiishaayi garuu Abneerin ariʼan; isaanis yeroo aduun dhiʼetti gaara Amaa kan karaa gammoojjii Gibeʼoonitti geessu irra Giiyaatti garagalee argamu sana gaʼan. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Namoonni Biniyaamis Abneer biratti walitti qabaman. Isaanis gareedhaan walgurmeessanii gaara Amaa gubbaatti hiriiran.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Abneeris iyyee Yooʼaabin waamee, “Goraadeen kun bara baraan waa galaafachuu qabaa? Akka dhumni waan kanaa hadhaaʼaa taʼe ati wallaalteetii? Ati hamma yoomiitti akka namoonni kee obboloota isaanii ariʼuu dhiisan itti hin himtu?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yooʼaab immoo deebisee, “Dhugaa Allaah jiraataa, utuu ati waan kana jechuu baattee silaa namoonni hamma lafti bariʼutti obboloota isaanii ariʼuu irraa hin deebiʼan ture” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaab malakata afuufe; namoonni hundis Israaʼeloota ariʼuu dhiisan; lammatas waraanni isaan gidduutti hin kaane.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abneerii fi namoonni isaa halkan sana guutuu Arabbaa keessa yaaʼanii darban. Isaanis Laga Yordaanos ceʼanii guutummaa Biitroon keessa darbanii gara Mahanayiim dhufan.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Ergasiis Yooʼaab Abneerin ariʼuu dhiisee namoota isaa hunda walitti qabe. Yeroo sanattis akka namoota Daawud keessaa Asaaheelin malee namoonni kudha sagal badan beekame. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Namoonni Daawud garuu namoota Biniyaam keessaa warra Abneer wajjin turan dhibba sadii fi jaatama ajjeesan. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Isaanis reeffa Asaaheel fudhatanii Beetlihemitti iddoo qabrii abbaa isaatti qabbaran. Yooʼaabii fi namoonni isaa halkan guutuu deemaa bulanii barii obboroo Kebroon gaʼan.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Mana Saaʼolii fi mana Daawud gidduu waraana bara dheeraatu ture. Yeroo Daawud jabaachaa deemetti manni Saaʼol immoo dadhabaa deeme.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Daawud Kebroonitti ijoollee dhalche; isaanis:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">Inni hangafni Amnoon isa Ahiinooʼam Yizriʼeelittiin deessee dha;<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />inni lammaffaan Kiliʼaab ilma Abiigayiil isheen Naabaal namichi biyya Qarmeloos irraa duʼe sun deessee dha;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:3">sadaffaan Abesaaloom ilma Maʼakaa kan intalli Talmaayi mooticha Geshuur sun deessee dha;<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />afuraffaan Adooniyaa ilma Hagiit;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:4">shanaffaan Shefaaxiyaa ilma Abiixaal;<verse eid="2SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />jaʼaffaan Yitreʼaam ilma Eglaa niitiin Daawud deessee dha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:5" />
  <para style="lf" vid="2SA 3:5">Isaan kunneen Kebroonitti Daawudiif dhalatan.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abneer Garee Daawud Taʼe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Yeroo mana Saaʼolii fi mana Daawud gidduu waraanni turetti Abneer mana Saaʼol irratti humna isaa jabeeffachaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Saaʼolis intala Ayyaa kan Riixiphaa jedhamtu saajjatoo godhatee ture. Iish-Booshetis Abneeriin, “Ati maaliif saajjatoo abbaa kootii wajjin rafte?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abneer immoo waan Iish-Booshet akkas jedheef akka malee aaree akkana jedhe; “Ani mataa saree Yihuudaatii? Ani hamma harʼaatti mana abbaa kee Saaʼoliif, mana maatii isaatii fi mana firoota isaatiif amanamaa dha. Siʼi illee dabarsee Daawuditti hin kennine. Ati garuu amma waaʼee dubartii kanaatiif na himatta! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Yoo ani akka abdiin Allaahan Daawudiif kenne sun raawwatamu gochuu baadhe Rabbii Allaahan Abneer irratti waan hamaa haa godhu; sana caalaa iyyuu isatti haa fidu; <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />wanni Allaahan kakuudhaan isa abdachiise sunis mana Saaʼol irraa mootummaa fuudhee Daanii jalqabee hamma Bersheebaatti Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa irratti teessoo Daawud jabeessee dhaabuu dha.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Iish-Booshet waan isa sodaateef Abneeritti waan tokko illee dubbachuu hin dandeenye.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ergasii Abneer, “Biyyattiin kan eenyuu ti? Na wajjin walii galtee godhadhu; anis akka Israaʼel guutumaan guutuutti gara kee goru sin gargaaraa” jedhee Daawuditti ergamoota erge.<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daawudis, “Gaarii dha; ani si wajjin walii galtee nan godhadha. Garuu waan tokko sin gaafadha; kunis ati yommuu gara koo dhuftutti jalqabatti Miikaal intala Saaʼol naa fidi; yoo kanaa achii gara koo hin dhufin” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ergasiis Daawud, “Niitii koo ishee ani misaa Filisxeemota dhibba tokkootiin kaadhimadhe Miikaalin naa ergi” jedhee Iish-Booshet ilma Saaʼolitti ergamoota erge.<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Kanaafuu Iish-Booshet nama ergee dhirsa ishee Phaltiiʼeel ilma Laayish irraa ishee fudhate. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Dhirsi ishees hamma magaalaa Bahuuriimitti booʼaa ishee duukaa buʼe. Abneeris, “Mana keetti deebiʼi!” jedheen. Kanaafuu inni ni deebiʼe.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abneer maanguddoota Israaʼel wajjin mariʼatee akkana jedhe; “Isin kanaan dura akka Daawud mootii keessan taʼu hawwaa turtan. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Rabbii Allaahan, ‘Ani garbicha koo Daawudiin saba Israaʼel harka Filisxeemotaatii akkasumas harka diinota isaanii hundaa keessaa nan baasa’ jedhee abdachiiseeraatii isin waan kana galmaan gaʼaa!”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abneer namoota Biniyaam birattis ni dubbate. Ergasiis Kebroon dhaqee waan Israaʼeloonnii fi manni Biniyaam hundi gochuu barbaadan Daawuditti hime. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Yommuu Abneer namoota isaa digdama wajjin Kebroon dhufetti, Daawud isaa fi namoota isaatiif cidha qopheesse. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abneeris Daawudiin, “Ani kaʼee deemee akka isaan gooftaa koo mootii wajjin kakuu galanii fi akka ati warra garaan kee fedhe hunda irratti mootii taatuuf Israaʼeloota hunda walitti nan qaba” jedhe. Kanaaf Daawud isa geggeesse; innis nagaadhaan deeme.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooʼaab Abneerin Ajjeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Namoonni Daawudii fi Yooʼaab yommuu suma boojuu hedduu fudhatanii duulaa galan. Abneer garuu Daawud wajjin Kebroon hin turre; Daawud isa geggeessee inni nagaan deemeeraatii. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yooʼaabii fi loltoonni isa wajjin turan hundi yommuu achi gaʼanitti akka Abneer ilmi Neer mooticha bira dhufee mootichi nagaan isa geggeesse isatti himame.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaab gara mootichaa dhaqee akkana jedhe; “Maali gochuu kee ti? Kunoo Abneer gara kee dhufee ture. Ati Maaliif isa geggeessite? Inni amma deemeera! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Ati Abneer ilma Neer ni beekta; inni si gowwoomsee sochii keetii fi waan ati gochaa jirtu hunda basaasuudhaaf dhufe.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yooʼaabis Daawud biraa baʼee Abneer duubaan ergamoota erge; isaanis boolla bishaanii kan Siiraa biraa isa deebisan. Daawud garuu waan kana hin beekne. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Yeroo Abneer Kebroonitti deebiʼettis Yooʼaab waan kophaatti isa wajjin haasaʼuu barbaade fakkeessee gara karraatti isa baase. Achittis haaloo dhiiga obboleessa isaa Asaaheel baasuuf garaa keessa isa waraane; innis ni duʼe.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Ergasii Daawud yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti akkana jedhe; “Anii fi mootummaan koo bara baraan dhiiga Abneer ilma Neer irraa fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti qulqulluu dha. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Cubbuun dhiiga isaa mataa Yooʼaabii fi mana abbaa isaa hundaa irra haa gaʼu! Namni madaa malaa yaasu yookaan lamxii qabu yookaan namni uleetti rarraʼee deemu yookaan namni goraadeen ajjeefamu yookaan namni waan nyaatu dhabu mana Yooʼaabii hin dhabamin.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Sababii inni lola Gibeʼoon irratti obboleessa isaanii Asaaheelin ajjeeseef Yooʼaabii fi obboleessi isaa Abiishaayi Abneerin ajjeesan.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Daawudis Yooʼaabii fi namoota isa wajjin turan hundaan, “Uffata keessan tarsaasaatii uffata gaddaa uffadhaa; fuula Abneer durattis booʼaa” jedhe. Daawud mootichis reeffa Abneer geggeesse. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Isaanis Abneerin Kebroonitti qabbaran; mootichis qabrii Abneer irratti iyyee booʼe; namoonni hundinuus ni booʼan.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mootichis faaruu gaddaa kana akkana jedhee Abneeriif faarse:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Abneer akka duʼa nama yaraa tokkootti duʼuu qabaa?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Harki kee hin hidhamne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">miilli kee foncaadhaan hin gaadiʼamne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Ati akkuma nama fuula hamootaa duratti kufu tokkootti kufte.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Namoonni hundinuu amma illee ni booʼaniif.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Gara saafaattis namoonni hundi dhufanii akka inni waa nyaatuuf Daawudin kadhatan; inni garuu, “Yoo ani hamma biiftuun lixxutti buddeena yookaan waan biraa afaan kootiin qabe Allaahan waan hamaa natti haa fidu; kana caalaa iyyuu natti haa fidu!” jedhee kakate.<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Namoonni hundinuu waan kana arganii gammadan; dhugumaan wanni mootichi godhe hundi isaan gammachiise. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Kanaafuu gaafa sana namoonni hundii fi Israaʼel hundi akka ajjeefamuu Abneer ilma Neer keessatti mootichi qooda hin qabne beekan.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Mootichis namoota isaatiin akkana jedhe; “Isin akka guyyaa harʼaa ilmi mootiitii fi namni guddaan tokko Israaʼel keessaa kufe hin beeknee? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Ani mootii dibame taʼu illee harʼa nama dadhabaa dha; ilmaan Zeruuyaa kunneen natti jabaataniiru. Rabbii Allaahan nama waan hamaa hojjetuuf akkuma hammina hojii isaatti isaaf haa kennu!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Iish-Booshet Ajjeefame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Iish-Booshet ilmi Saaʼol yommuu akka Abneer Kebroonitti ajjeefame dhagaʼetti humni isaa ni buʼe; Israaʼel hundis sodaan guutame. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Yeroo sanatti Iish-Booshet ilmi Saaʼol dura buutota garee duultotaa lama qaba ture. Inni tokko Baʼanaa, kaan immoo Rekaab jedhama ture; isaanis ilmaan Rimoon namicha Biʼeeroot kan gosa Biniyaam sanaa ti; Biʼeeroot kun akka kutaa Biniyaamitti lakkaaʼama; <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />namoonni Biʼeeroot kunneen gara Gitayimitti baqatanii hamma harʼaatti alagummaan achi jiraatuutii.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yoonaataan ilmi Saaʼol mucaa miilli isaa lachuu naafate tokko qaba ture. Yeroo oduun waaʼee Saaʼolii fi Yoonaataan Yizriʼeel irraa dhufetti inni nama waggaa shanii ture. Guddiftuun isaas isa fudhattee baqatte; garuu utuu isheen baqachuuf ariifattuu mucichi ishee irraa kufee naafate. Maqaan isaas Mefiibooshet jedhama ture.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Rekaabii fi Baʼanaan ilmaan Rimoon namicha gosa Biʼeeroot kaʼanii gara mana Iish-Boosheti qajeelan; yeroon isaan itti achi gaʼanis guyyaa saafaa yeroo inni itti aara galfatu ture. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Isaanis akka nama qamadii barbaaduutti kutaa manaa isa gara keessaatti ol seenanii garaa isaa waraanan. Ergasiis Rekaabii fi obboleessi isaa Baʼanaan miliqanii baʼan.<verse eid="2SA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Isaanis utuu inni kutaa ciisichaa keessa siree isaa irra rafee jiruu ol seenan. Erga garaa isaa waraananii isa ajjeesanii booddees mataa isaa irraa kutan. Mataa sanas fuudhanii halkan guutuu daandii Arabbaa irra deemaa bulan. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Isaanis Kebroonitti mataa Iish-Booshet gara Daawud mootichaa fidanii, “Kunoo mataa Iish-Booshet ilma diina kee Saaʼol kan ilma namicha si ajjeesuu barbaadu sanaa. Harʼa Rabbii Allaahan Saaʼolii fi sanyii isaa illee gooftaa koo mootichaaf haaloo baaseera” jedhaniin.<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Daawud immoo Rekaabii fi obboleessa isaa Baʼanaa, ilmaan Rimoonii namicha gosa Biʼeerootaa sanaan akkana jedhe; “Dhugaa Rabbii Allaah jiraataa isa rakkina hunda jalaa na baase sanaa, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />kunoo ani namicha waan oduu gaarii naa fide seʼee, ‘Saaʼol duʼeera’ jedhee natti hime sana qabee Siiqlaagitti ajjeeseera. Egaa wanni ani namicha oduu sana fide badhaase kana dha! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Yoos yeroo namoonni hamooni nama balleessaa hin qabne tokko mana isaa keessatti, siree isaa irratti ajjeesanitti ani dhiiga isaa harka keessan irraa hin barbaaduu ree? Lafa irraas hin balleessuu ree?”<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Kanaafuu Daawud namoota isaa ajaje; isaanis jara ajjeesan. Harkaa fi miilla isaanii irraa kukkutanii haroo Kebroon biratti reeffa isaanii fannisan. Mataa Iish-Booshet garuu fuudhanii Kebroonitti qabrii Abneer biratti qabbaran.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Daawud Israaʼel Irratti Mootii Taʼe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:1-3">5:1‑3</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 11:1-3">1Sn 11:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Gosoonni Israaʼel hundi Kebroonitti Daawud bira dhufanii akkana jedhan; “Nu foonii fi dhiiga kee ti. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Duraan yeroo Saaʼol mootii keenya turetti, namni duula loltoota Israaʼel hoogganu siʼi ture. Rabbii Allaahanis, ‘Situ saba koo Israaʼelin tiksa; bulchaa isaaniis ni taata’ siin jedhee ture.”<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Yommuu maanguddoonni Israaʼel hundi Kebroonitti Daawud mooticha bira dhufanitti mootichi Kebroonitti fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti isaan wajjin kakuu gale; isaanis Daawudin dibanii Israaʼel irratti mootii isa godhan.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daawud yeroo mootii taʼetti umuriin isaa waggaa soddoma ture; innis waggaa afurtama bulche. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Kebroon keessatti waggaa torbaa fi jiʼa jaʼa Yihuudaa irratti mootii ture; Yerusaalem keessatti immoo waggaa soddomii sadii guutummaa Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa irratti mootii taʼe.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Yerusaalem Qabachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:6-10">5:6‑10</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 11:4-9">1Sn 11:4‑9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">5:11‑16</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 3:5-9">1Sn 3:5‑9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1‑7</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Mootichii fi namoonni isaa Yebuusota achi jiraatan loluuf gara Yerusaalemitti ni qajeelan. Yebuusonnis Daawudiin, “Ati as hin seentu; jaamaa fi naafni iyyuu of irraa si deebisu” jedhan. Isaan, “Daawud as seenuu hin dandaʼu” jedhanii yaadan. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Taʼus Daawud daʼannoo Xiyoon Magaalaa Daawud ni qabate.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Daawudis gaafas, “Namni Yebuusota dhaʼuuf baʼu kam iyyuu, ‘Naafotaa fi jaamota’ lubbuu Daawudiin jibbaman bira gaʼuuf karaa boʼoo bishaaniitiin darbuu qaba” jedhe. Sababiin isaan, “ ‘Jaamonnii fi naafonni’ masaraa mootii hin seenan” jedhaniif kanuma.<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daawudis iddoo jireenya isaa daʼannoo sana godhatee Magaalaa Daawud jedhee moggaase. Inni Miiloodhaa jalqabee naannoo ishee marsee ijaare. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Innis sababii Rabbii Allaahan, Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu isa wajjin tureef yeruma yeroon jabaachaa dhufe.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Yeroo kanatti Hiiraam mootiin Xiiroos ergamoota wajjin muka birbirsaa, namoota muka soofanii fi warra dhagaa soofan gara Daawud erge; isaanis Daawudiif masaraa ijaaran. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Daawudis akka Rabbii Allaahan saba Israaʼel irratti mootii godhee jabeessee isa dhaabee fi akka saba Israaʼeliif jedhee mootummaa isaa guddiseef ni beeke.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daawudis erga Kebroonii baʼee booddee saajjatoowwanii fi niitota biraa Yerusaalem keessatti fuudhe; ilmaanii fi intallan dabalataa dhalataniif. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Maqaan ijoollee isaa kanneen achitti isaaf dhalataniis Shamuuʼaa, Shobaab, Naataan, Suleyimaan, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Yibehaar, Eliishuuwaa, Nefeg, Yaafiiyaa, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Eliishaamaa, Eliyaadaa fi Eliiphelexi jedhamu.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Filisxeemota Moʼachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">5:17‑25</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1Sn 14:8‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Filisxeemonni yommuu akka Daawud dibamee Israaʼel irratti mootii taʼe dhagaʼanitti, humna guutuudhaan isa barbaacha ol baʼan; Daawud garuu waan kana dhagaʼee gara daʼannoo jabaatti gad buʼe. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Yeroo kanatti Filisxeemonni dhufanii Sulula Refaayim keessa faffacaʼan; <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />kanaafuu Daawud, “Ani baʼee Filisxeemota dhaʼuu? Ati dabarsitee harka kootti isaan kennitaa?” jedhee Rabbii Allaah gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Rabbii Allaahanis, “Baʼi; ani dhugumaan Filisxeemota dabarsee harka keetti nan kennaatii” jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Kanaafuu Daawud gara Baʼaal Pheraaziim dhaqe; achittis isaan moʼate. Innis, “Akkuma bishaan mana isaa cabsee yaaʼu sana Rabbii Allaahan fuula koo duratti diinota koo cabsee baʼeera” jedhe. Kanaafuu iddoon sun Baʼaal Pheraaziim jedhamee waamame. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Filisxeemonni waaqeffatamtoota isaanii tolfamoo achitti dhiisanii baqatan; Daawudii fi namoonni isaa immoo isaan fuudhanii deeman.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Filisxeemonni amma illee dhufanii Sulula Refaayim keessa faffacaʼan; <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />kanaafuu Daawud Rabbii Allaah gaafate; Allaahanis akkana jedheen; “Kallattiidhaan itti hin baʼin; garuu duubaan isaan marsiitii muka qilxuu duratti isaan waraani. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Akkuma fiixee muka qilxuu irraan sagalee duulaa dhageesseen dafiitii baʼi; Rabbii Allaahan loltoota Filisxeem dhaʼuudhaaf si dura baʼeera jechuudhaatii.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Kanaafuu Daawud akkuma Rabbii Allaahan isa ajaje sana Gibeʼoon jalqabee hamma Geeziritti Filisxeemota dhaʼe.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Taabonni Gara Yerusaalemitti Fidamuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">6:1‑11</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1Sn 13:1‑14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 6:12-19">6:12‑19</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:3">1Sn 15:25–16:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daawud ammas namoota Israaʼel keessaa filataman kuma soddoma walitti qabate. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Innii fi namoonni isa wajjin turan hundi taabota Allaaha kan Maqaa, maqaa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu kan taabota gubbaa, kiirubeelii teessoo irra jiran gidduu jiru sanaatiin waamamu sana achii fiduuf gara Baʼaalaa ishee Yihuudaa keessaa sanaa ni dhaqan. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Isaanis taabota Allaaha gaarii haaraa irra kaaʼanii mana Abiinaadaab kan gaara irra jiru sanaa baasanii fidan. Ilmaan Abiinaadaabii, Uzaa fi Ahiiyoon gaarii haaraa sana oofaa turan; <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />taabonni Allaahas gaarii irra kaaʼamee Ahiiyoon dura dura deema ture. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daawudii fi Israaʼel hundinuu humna isaanii guutuudhaan faarfannaadhaan, masiinqoodhaan, baganaadhaan, dibbeedhaan, bilbilaan, Kililleedhaanis fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti gammadanii shuubbisaa turan.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Yommuu isaan oobdii Naakoon bira gaʼanitti waan sangoonni gufataniif Uzaan harka isaa hiixatee taabota Allaaha qabe. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Sababii hojii isaa kan ulfina hin qabneetiif dheekkamsi Rabbii Allaah Uzaatti bobaʼe; kanaafuu Allaahan isa rukute; innis achumatti taabota Allaaha biratti duʼe.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Daawudis sababii Rabbii Allaahan akka malee Uzaatti dheekkameef ni aare; iddoon sun hamma harʼaatti Phereez Uzaa jedhamee waamama.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Daawudis gaafa sana Rabbii Allaah sodaatee, “Taabonni Rabbii Allaah akkamitti gara koo dhufa?” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Innis akka taabonni Rabbii Allaah isa wajjin Magaalaa Daawud keessa jiraatuuf ofitti fudhachuu hin barbaanne. Qooda kanaa gara mana Oobeed Edoom namicha Gitii sanaatti geesse. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Taabonni Rabbii Allaahas jiʼa sadii mana namicha Gitii kan Oobeed Edoom jedhamu sanaa ture; Rabbii Allaahanis isaa fi warra mana isaa jiraatan hunda ni eebbise.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Yeroo kanatti, “Rabbii Allaahan sababii taabota Allaahatiif jedhee warra mana Oobeed Edoom jiraatanii fi waan inni qabu hunda ni eebbise” jedhanii Daawud Mootichatti himan. Kanaafuu Daawud gad buʼee taabota Allaaha sana mana Abiidaaraatii gammachuudhaan gara Magaalaa Daawuditti fide. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Innis akkuma namoonni taabota Rabbii Allaah baatan sun tarkaanfii jaʼa achi hiiqaniin sangaa tokkoo fi jabbii coomaa tokko aarsaa dhiʼeesse. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daawudis Dirata quncee talbaa irraa hojjetame uffatee qondaaltota isaa wajjin fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti humna isaa guutuun shuubbisa ture; <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />innii fi Israaʼel hundi “hoo” jechaa sagalee malakataatiin taabota Rabbii Allaah fidan.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Yeroo taabonni Rabbii Allaah Magaalaa Daawud seenutti Miikaal intalli Saaʼol foddaa keessaan ilaalaa turte. Isheenis akka Daawud Mootichi fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti utaalee shuubbisu yommuu argitetti garaa ishee keessatti isa tuffatte.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Isaanis taabota Rabbii Allaah fidanii dunkaana Daawud dhaabeef keessa ni kaaʼan; Daawudis aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaa nagaa fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti dhiʼeesse. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Innis erga aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaa nagaa dhiʼeessee booddee maqaa Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandaʼuutiin namoota ni eebbise. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Ergasiis inni tokkoo tokkoo nama tuuta Israaʼelootaa guutuu keessa jiruutiif jechuunis dhiirotaafis dubartootaafis buddeena tokko tokko, gumaa foonii tokko tokkoo fi bixxillee ija wayinii tokko tokko ni kenne. Namoonni hundinuus gara mana mana isaanii deeman.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Yommuu Daawud maatii ofii isaa eebbisuuf deebiʼettis Miikaal intalli Saaʼol isa simachuuf baatee, “Harʼa mootiin Israaʼel akka nama gatii hin qabne tokkootti fuula xomboreewwan hojjettoota isaa duratti qullaa argamuun isaa ulfina taʼeeti moo!” jette.<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daawud immoo Miikaaliin akkana jedhe; “Ani fuula Rabbii Allaah isa abbaa keetii fi warra mana isaa jiran caalchisee na filatee saba Rabbii Allaaha, Israaʼel irratti na muude sanaaf fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti nan shuubbisa. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Ani kana caalaa iyyuu ofin xinneessa; ija kee durattis of nan salphisa. Xomboreewwan ati jette kanneeniin garuu nan kabajama.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Miikaal intalli Saaʼol utuu ijoollee hin argatin duute.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Abdii Allaahan Daawudiif Kenne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">7:1‑17</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1Sn 17:1‑15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Mootichi erga masaraa isaa keessa jiraachuu jalqabee Rabbii Allaahan diinota isaa kanneen naannoo isaa jiran hunda jalaa isa boqochiisee booddee, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Naataan nabiiʼiyyichaan, “Ani kunoo mana birbirsaan ijaarame keessan jiraadha; taabonni Allaaha garuu dunkaana keessa jiraata” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Naataan immoo mootichaan, “Rabbii Allaahan si wajjin jiraatii waan garaa keetti yaadde kam iyyuu godhi” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Halkan sana garuu dubbiin Rabbii Allaah akkana jedhee gara Naataan dhufe:<verse eid="2SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Dhaqiitii akkana jedhii garbicha koo Daawuditti himi; ‘Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: Kan mana ani keessa jiraadhu naaf ijaaru siʼii? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Ani gaafan Israaʼeloota Gibxii baasee jalqabee hamma harʼaatti mana keessa hin jiraanne. Ani iddoo jireenya koo dunkaana godhadhee iddoo tokkoo gara iddoo biraa naannaʼaan ture. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ani iddoon Israaʼeloota hunda wajjin naannaʼaa ture kamitti iyyuu bulchitoota akka isaan saba koo Israaʼelin eeganiif ajaje keessaa nama tokkoon iyyuu, “Isin maaliif mana birbirsaa naaf hin ijaarre?” jedhee beekaa?’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Egaa amma akkana jedhii garbicha koo Daawuditti himi; ‘Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu akkana jedha: Ani akka ati bulchaa saba koo Israaʼel taatuuf lafa tikaatii fi bushaayee faana deemuu keessaan si fudhadhe. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Ani lafa ati dhaqxe hundatti si wajjinin ture; diinota kee hundas fuula kee duraa balleesseera. Ammas ani maqaa kee akkuma maqaa namoota addunyaa irratti akka malee gurguddaa taʼanii guddaa nan godha. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Ani akka isaan mana ofii isaanii qabaatanii fi siʼachi hin raafamneef saba koo Israaʼeliif lafa kennee isaan nan dhaaba. Namoonni hamoon akka jalqabatti godhan sana deebiʼanii isaan hin cunqursan; <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />isaan siʼachi waan gaafa ani saba koo Israaʼel irratti abbootii murtii muudee as godhan sana illee hin godhan. Ani diinota kee hunda jalaas sin boqochiisa.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘Akka Rabbii Allaahan mataan isaa mana siif ijaaru Rabbii Allaahan sittin hima; <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />yommuu barri jireenya keetii dhumee ati abbootii kee wajjin boqottutti ani akka inni iddoo kee buʼuuf sanyii kee kan gudeeda keetii baʼu nan kaasa; mootummaa isaa illee jabeessee nan dhaaba. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Kan maqaa kootiif mana ijaaru isa; anis teessoo mootummaa isaa bara baraan jabeessee nan dhaaba. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Ani isaaf abbaa nan taʼa; innis ilma naa taʼa. Yommuu inni balleessaa hojjetuttis ulee namootaatiin isa nan adaba; alangee ilmaan namaa ittiin garafamaniinis nan garafa. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Jaalalli koo garuu akka jaalala ani Saaʼol isa ani fuula kee duraa balleesse sana irraa fudhadhe isa irraa hin fudhatamu. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Mannii fi mootummaan kee bara baraan fuula koo dura ni jiraata; teessoon kees bara baraan jabaatee ni dhaabata.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Naataanis dubbii mulʼata kanaa hunda Daawuditti hime.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Duʼaa gochuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">7:18‑29</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1Sn 17:16‑27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Ergasii Daawud mootichi ol seenee fuula Rabbii Allaah dura taaʼee akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, kan ati asiin na geesse ani eenyu? Maatiin koos maali? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, akka waan wanni kun fuula kee duratti gaʼaa hin taʼiniitti ati waaʼee mana garbicha keetii kan fuul duratti taʼus dubbatte. Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, edaa walitti dhufeenyi ati namoota wajjin qabdu kanaa?<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />“Daawud kana caalaa maal jechuu dandaʼa? Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, ati garbicha kee ni beektaatii. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ati sababii dubbii keetiitii fi akkuma fedhii keetiitti waan guddaa kana hojjettee akka garbichi kee beeku goote.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />“Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, ati akkam guddaa dha! Kan akka keetii tokko iyyuu hin jiru; akka nu gurruma keenyaan dhageenyetti si malee Allaahan biraa hin jiru. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Sabni akka saba kee Israaʼel, kan Allaahan akka inni saba isaa taʼuuf maqaa ofii isaa dhaabbachuuf jedhee isa furuuf saboota ormaatii fi waaqeffatamtoota isaanii illee fuula isaa duraa ariʼuudhaan dinqiiwwan gurguddaa fi sodaachisaa argisiisuudhaan baʼee biyya Gibxii furee baase kan biraa lafa irraa kamii dha? <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Ati saba kee Israaʼelin kan ofii keetii gootee bara baraan dhaabdeerta; yaa Rabbii Allaah ati Allaah isaanii taateerta.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Ammas yaa Rabbii Allaah, yaa Allaah, ati waadaa garbicha keetii fi mana isaatiif galte sana bara baraan eegi. Kanas akkuma waadaa galte sana raawwadhu; <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />kunis akka maqaan kee bara baraan guddaa taʼuuf. Kana irratti namoonni, ‘Rabbii Allaahan Waan Hunda Dandaʼu Israaʼel irratti Allaah!’ ni jedhu. Manni garbicha kee Daawudis fuula kee duratti jabaatee ni dhaabata.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />“Rabbii Allaah Waan Hunda Dandeessu, Allaah Israaʼel ati, ‘Ani mana siif nan ijaara’ jettee garbicha keetti waan kana mulʼifteerta; kanaafuu garbichi kee duʼaa kana sitti dhiʼeessuuf ija jabina argateera. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, ati Allaah! Dubbiin kee amanamaa dha; atis waan gaarii kana garbicha keetiif waadaa galteerta. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Akka manni isaa bara baraan jabaattee fuula kee dura dhaabatuuf ammas mana garbicha keetii eebbisuun fedhii kee haa taʼu; yaa Rabbii Allaah Gooftaa, ati dubbatteertaatii; eebba keetiinis manni garbicha keetii bara baraan ni eebbifama.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Moʼannoowwan Daawud</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">8:1‑14</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 18:1-13">1Sn 18:1‑13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Ergasii Daawud Filisxeemota moʼatee of jala isaan galfate; magaalaa Meeteeg Amaa jedhamtus harka Filisxeemotaatii baasee fudhate.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Daawud Moʼaabotas ni moʼate. Lafa irra tarree ciibsees funyoon isaan safare. Kanneen tarree galan keessaas funyoo lama lama safaree ajjeese; kanneen funyoo tokko tokko safare immoo akka isaan jiraatan eeyyameef. Kanaafuu Moʼaabonni Daawud jalatti bulanii gibira fidaniif.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Kana irrattis Daawud yeroo Laga Efraaxiis bira yaadannoo ofii deebisee dhaabbachuu dhaqetti mooticha Zoobaa, Hadaadezer ilma Rehoob moʼate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daawudis gaariiwwan waraanaa isaa kuma tokko, abbootii fardaa kuma torbaa fi loltoota lafoo kuma digdama isa irraa fudhate. Innis fardeen gaariiwwanii dhibba tokko qofa hambisee kanneen hafan hunda mogolee kukkute.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Yeroo warri Sooriyaa kanneen Damaasqoo jiraatan Hadaadezer mooticha Zoobaa gargaaruuf dhufanittis Daawud isaan keessaa nama kuma digdamii lama fixe. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Ergasiis kutaa bulchiinsa Damaasqoo kan biyya Sooriyaa keessa qubata loltootaa dhaabbate. Warri Sooriyaas isa jalatti bulanii gibira fidaniif. Rabbii Allaahanis Daawudiif lafa inni dhaqe hundatti mooʼicha kenne.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daawudis gaachana warqee kan ajajjoonni loltoota Hadaadezer qabatan fudhatee gara Yerusaalem fide. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Daawud Mootichi magaalaawwan Hadaadezer jechuunis Bexaatii fi Beerootaay keessaa sibiila naasii akka malee baayʼee fudhate.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Tooʼiin mootiin Hamaati yommuu akka Daawud guutummaa loltoota Hadaadezer moʼate dhagaʼetti, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />akka inni sababii moʼannaa Daawud Mootichi Tooʼiin wal lolaa ture sun waraana keessatti Hadaadezer irratti argateetiif harka isa fuudhee dhaamsa gammachuu isaaf dabarsuuf ilma ofii isaa Yooraamin gara isaatti erge. Yooraamis kennaawwan meetii irraa, warqee fi naasii irraa hojjetaman fide.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Daawud Mootichis akkuma meetii fi warqee saboota biraa kanneen of jala galfatu hunda irraa boojiʼee ture godhe sana miʼoota kanneen illee Rabbii Allaahaf addaan baase. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Warri inni of jala galfates Edoom, Moʼaab, Amoonota, Filisxeemotaa fi Amaaleq turan. Boojuu Hadaadezer ilma Rehoob mooticha Zoobaa irraa boojiʼes akkasuma addaan baase.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daawudis erga Sulula Soogiddaa keessatti Edoomota kuma kudha saddeet fixee deebiʼee booddee beekamaa taʼe.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Innis guutummaa Edoom keessa qubata loltootaa dhaabbate; Edoomonni hundinuus Daawudiif ni garbooman. Rabbii Allaahanis lafa inni dhaqe hundatti Daawudiif moʼannaa ni kenne.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qondaaltota Daawud</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 8:15-18">8:15‑18</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 18:14-17">1Sn 18:14‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Daawud guutummaa Israaʼel irratti mootii taʼee saba isaa hundaaf murtii qajeelaa fi qajeelummaadhaan hojjete. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yooʼaab ilmi Zeruuyaa hoogganaa loltootaa ture; Yehooshaafaax ilmi Ahiiluud immoo galmeessaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Akkasumas Zaadoq ilmi Ahiixuubii fi Abiimelek ilmi Abiyaataar luboota turan; Seraayaan immoo barreessaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaayaa ilmi Yehooyaadaa hoogganaa Kereetotaa fi Pheletotaa ture; ilmaan Daawud immoo luboota turan.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Daawudii fi Mefiiboostee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Daawudis, “Akka ani Yoonaataaniif jedhee arjummaa isaaf godhu namni maatii Saaʼol keessaa hafe amma jiraa?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Yeroo sanatti namicha Ziibaa jedhamu tajaajilaa mana Saaʼol tokkotu ture. Innis akka fuula Daawud duratti dhiʼaatuuf waamame; mootichis, “Ati Ziibaadhaa?” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Innis, “Eeyyee, ana garbicha kee ti” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mootichis, “Akka ani arjummaa Allaaha isaaf godhuuf namni maatii Saaʼol keessaa hafe tokko iyyuu hin jiruu?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Ziibaa, “Ilmi Yoonaataan tokko jira; miilli isaa lachuus naafa” jedhee mootichaaf deebise.<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mootichis, “Inni eessa jira?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Ziibaan deebisee, “Inni iddoo Lodebaar jedhamu mana Maakiir ilma Amiiʼeel jira” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Kanaafuu Daawud mootichi nama ergee Lodebaar mana Maakiir ilma Amiiʼeeliitii isa fichisiise.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Mefiibooshet ilmi Yoonaataan, ilmi Saaʼol yeroo Daawud bira dhufetti ulfina isaaf kennuuf gad jedhe sagadeef.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Daawud immoo, “Mefiiboostee!” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Innis, “Garbichi kee kunoo ti” jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daawudis, “Ani abbaa kee Yoonaataaniif jedhee arjummaa siifin godhaatii hin sodaatin. Ani lafa akaakayyuu keetii, lafa Saaʼol hunda siifin deebisa; atis yeroo hunda maaddii koo irraa nyaatta” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefiibooshetis harka fuudhee, “Ana garbicha kee nama akka saree duʼeetti ilaalamuuf waan kana gochuun kee maaliif?” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Mootichis Ziibaa garbicha Saaʼol ofitti waamee akkana jedheen; “Ani ilma ilma gooftaa keetiitiif, waan kan Saaʼolii fi kan maatii isaa taʼe hunda kenneera. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Ati, Ilmaan keetii fi tajaajiltoonni kee akka ilmi ilma gooftaa keetii waan nyaatu argatuuf lafa isaaf qotuu qabdu. Mefiibooshet ilmi ilma gooftaa keetiis yeroo hunda maaddii koo irraa nyaata.” Ziibaan ilmaan kudha shanii fi tajaajiltoota digdama qaba ture.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ziibaanis mootichaan, “Ani garbichi kee waan gooftaan koo mootichi akka ani hojjedhuuf na ajaju hunda nan godha” jedhe. Kanaafuu Mefiibooshet akkuma ilmaan mootii keessaa nama tokkootti maaddii Daawud irraa nyaata ture.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefiibooshet ilma dargaggeessa Miikaa jedhamu tokko qaba ture; warri mana Ziibaa jiraatan hundi hojjettoota Mefiiboostee turan. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Mefiibooshetis sababii yeroo hunda maaddii mootii irraa nyaachaa tureef Yerusaalem keessa jiraata ture; miilli isaa lachuu naafa ture.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Daawud Amoonota Moʼachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">10:1‑19</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1Sn 19:1‑19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Ergasiis mootiin Amoonotaa ni duʼe; ilmi isaa Haanuunis iddoo isaa buʼee mootii taʼe. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Daawudis, “Akkuma abbaan isaa naa arjoome sana anis Haanuun ilma Naahaashiif nan arjooma” jedhee yaade. Kanaafuu Daawud gadda waaʼee abbaa isaatiif itti dhagaʼame isaa ibsuuf Haanuunitti ergamoota ni erge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Yommuu namoonni Daawud gara biyya Amoonotaa dhaqanitti, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />qondaaltonni Amoonotaa Haanuun gooftaa isaaniitiin, “Ati sababii Daawud akka isaan dhaamsa gaddaa sitti himaniif namoota sitti ergeef inni waan abbaa keetiif ulfina kenne seetaa? Daawud akka isaan magaalattii qoratanii, basaasanii fi qabataniif gara kee isaan erge mitii?” jedhan. <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Kanaafuu Haanuun namoota Daawud sana qaqqabee tokkoo tokkoo isaanii irraa hareeda gama tokkoo haadee wayyaa isaanii illee teessuma irratti cicciree of irraa isaan erge.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Daawud yommuu wanni kun isatti himametti sababii isaan akka malee qaanaʼaniif namoota sanatti ergamoota erge. Mootichis, “Isin hamma areedni keessan isinii guddatutti Yerikoo turaatii ergasii deebiʼaa kottaa” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Amoononni yommuu akka Daawud isaan xireeffate hubatanitti, Beet Rehoobii fi Suubaadhaa loltoota lafoo kan Sooriyaa kuma digdama, mootii Maʼakaa namoota kuma tokko wajjin akkasumas Xoob irraa namoota kuma kudha lama qaxaratan.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daawud yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti Yooʼaabii fi guutummaa loltootaa ni erge. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Amoononni immoo baʼanii karra magaalaa sanaa irratti waraanaaf hiriiran; namoonni Sooriyaa warri Suubaa fi Rehoob, akkasumas namoonni Xoobiitii fi Maʼakaa immoo kophaa isaanii dirree irra turan.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yooʼaabis akka fuula isaa duraa fi dugda isaa duubaan waraanni jiru ni arge; kanaafuu loltoota Israaʼel keessaa namoota bebeekamoo filatee adda loltoonni Sooriyaa jiranitti bobbaase. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Namoota hafan immoo ajaja obboleessa isaa Abiishaayi jalatti hiriirsee Amoonotatti isaan duulchise. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yooʼaabis akkana jedhe; “Yoo warri Sooriyaa natti jabaatan ati dhuftee na gargaarta; yoo Amoononni sitti jabaatan immoo ani dhufee sin gargaara. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Jabaadhu; saba keenyaa fi magaalaawwan Allaah keenyaatiif garaa kutannaadhaan haa lollu. Rabbii Allaahanis waan fuula isaa duratti gaarii taʼe ni godha.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ergasii Yooʼaabii fi loltoonni isa wajjin turan warra Sooriyaa waraanuuf fuul duratti ni qajeelan; jarris fuula isaa duraa baqatan. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Amoononni yommuu akka namoonni Sooriyaa baqatan arganitti isaanis Abiishaayi duraa baqatanii magaalaa seenan. Akkasiin Yooʼaab Amoonota waraanuu dhiisee Yerusaalemitti deebiʼe.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Namoonni Sooriyaa yommuu akka Israaʼeloonni isaan moʼatan arganitti lammata walitti qabaman. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadaadezeris ergamoota ergee namoota Sooriyaa kanneen Laga Efraaxiisiitiin gamaa fichisiise; isaanis hoogganummaa ajajaa waraana Hadaadezer kan Shoobak jedhamuun gara Heelaam deeman.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daawudis yommuu wanni kun isatti himametti, Israaʼeloota hunda walitti qabatee Yordaanos ceʼee Heelaam dhaqe. Warri Sooriyaas waraanaaf Daawuditti hiriiranii isa lolan. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Isaan garuu Israaʼeloota duraa baqatan; Daawudis namoota gaarii waraanaa oofan dhibba torbaa fi loltoota lafoo kuma afurtama fixe. Ajajaa loltoota isaanii Shoobak illee madeesse; innis achumatti duʼe. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Mootonni Hadaadezerin tajaajilaa turan hundi yommuu akka Israaʼelootaan moʼataman arganitti, Israaʼeloota wajjin nagaa uumanii isa jalatti bulan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Kanaafuu namoonni Sooriyaa ergasii Amoonota gargaaruu sodaatan.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Daawudii fi Batisheebaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Birraa keessa yeroo mootonni waraanaaf baʼanitti, Daawud tajaajiltoota isaatii fi loltoota Israaʼel hunda wajjin Yooʼaabin erge. Isaanis Amoonota barbadeessanii magaalaa Rabbaa jedhamtu marsan. Daawud garuu Yerusaalemitti hafe.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Gaaf tokko galgala Daawud siree isaa irraa kaʼee bantii masaraa mootummaa irra asii fi achi deddeebiʼaa ture. Innis bantii gubbaa dhaabatee dubartii dhagna ishee dhiqattu tokko arge. Dubartiin sun baayʼee bareedduu turte; <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daawudis waaʼee ishee beekuuf nama itti erge. Namichi sunis, “Isheen Batisheebaa intala Eliʼaam, niitii Uuriyaa namicha gosa Heet sanaatii mitii?” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Daawudis nama itti ergee ishee fichisiise. Isheenis gara isaa dhufte; innis ishee wajjin ciise. Isheen xuraaʼummaa ishee irraa qulqullooftee turte. Ergasii gara mana isheetti deebite. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Dubartiin sun ulfooftee, “Ani ulfaaʼeera” jettee Daawuditti ergaa ergite.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Kanaafuu Daawud, “Uuriyaa namicha gosa Heet sana naa ergi” jedhee Yooʼaabitti dhaamsa erge. Yooʼaabis gara Daawuditti isa erge. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Daawudis yommuu Uuriyaan gara isaa dhufetti waaʼee Yooʼaab, waaʼee loltootaatii fi haala waraanni keessa jiru isa gaafate. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Ergasii immoo Daawud Uuriyaan, “Gara mana keetiitti gad buʼiitii miilla kee dhiqadhu” jedhe. Kanaafuu Uuriyaan masaraa mootiitii baʼee deeme; kennaan mootichaas isa faana ergame. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Uuriyaan garuu tajaajiltoota gooftaa isaa hunda wajjin karra masaraa mootii dura ciise malee gara mana ofii isaatti gad hin buune.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daawudis yommuu akka Uuriyaan gara mana isaa hin deemin itti himametti, “Ati reefuu karaadhaa dhufte mitii? Maaliif gara mana keetii hin deemne?” jedhee isa gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uuriyaan immoo Daawudiin, “Taabonnii fi Israaʼel, Yihuudaanis dunkaana keessa jiru; gooftaan koo Yooʼaabii fi namoonni gooftaa koo dirree irra bulu. Egaa ani akkamitti nyaachuu fi dhuguuf, niitii koo wajjinis rafuuf jedhee gara mana koo deema? Duʼa kee ti; ani waan akkasii hin godhu!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Daawud, “Ati harʼas as buliitii ani bor sin geggeessaa” jedheen. Kanaafuu Uuriyaan gaafa sanaa fi guyyaa itti aanu Yerusaalem keessa ture. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daawudis isa affeere; innis fuula isaa duratti nyaatee dhuge; Daawudis isa macheesse. Uuriyaan garuu halkan sana afata isaa irra tajaajiltoota gooftaa isaa gidduu ciisuuf gad baʼe malee gara mana ofii isaa hin deemne.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Daawudis lafti bariinaan xalayaa barreessee harkuma Uuriyaatiin Yooʼaabitti erge. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Xalayicha keessattis, “Iddoo waraanni itti cimetti Uuriyaa ramadi. Akka inni achitti dhaʼamee duʼuufis isa dhiisaa duubatti deebiʼaa” jedhee barreesse.<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaab utuu magaalattii marsaa jiruu iddoo akka loltoonni ciccimoon jiran beeketti Uuriyaa ramade. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Yommuu namoonni magaalaa sanaa itti gad baʼanii Yooʼaabin lolanitti, loltoota Daawud keessaa namoonni tokko tokko duʼan; Uuriyaan namichi gosa Heet sunis ni ajjeefame.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Yooʼaabis guutummaa oduu waaʼee lola sanaa Daawudiif erge. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Akkana jedhees malaʼikkaa sana ajaje; “Yommuu ati waaʼee waraana kanaa mootichatti himtee fixxutti, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />aariin mootichaa ni bobaʼa; innis akkana jedhee si gaafachuu dandaʼa; ‘Isin maaliif loluuf akkas magaalaa sanatti dhiʼaattan? Isin akka isaan dallaa irraa xiyya isinitti darbatan hin beeknee? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Eenyutu Abiimelek ilma Yirubesheet sana ajjeese? Dubartiin tokko dallaa irraa majii dhagaa daakuu itti gad dhiiftee Tebeesitti isa hin ajjeefnee? Isin maaliif akkas dallaa sanatti dhiʼaattan?’ Yoo inni waan kana si gaafate, ‘Tajaajilaan kee Uuriyaan namichi gosa Heet sunis duʼeera’ jedhii itti himi.”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Malaʼikkaan sunis kaʼee deemee yommuu achi gaʼetti waan Yooʼaab akka inni itti himu isa ajaje hunda Daawuditti hime. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Malaʼikkaan sun Daawudiin akkana jedhe; “Namoonni nutti jabaatanii dirreetti gad nutti baʼan; nus ariinee gara karra magaalattiitti isaan deebifne. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Ergasiis warri xiyya darbatan dallaa irraa tajaajiltoota keetti darbatan; namoonni mootii tokko tokkos ni duʼan. Tajaajilaan kee Uuriyaan namichi Heet sunis ni duʼe.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daawudis malaʼikkaa sanaan, “Egaa akkana jedhii Yooʼaabitti himi; ‘Wanni kun abdii si hin kutachiisin; goraadeen yeroo tokko isa tokko, yeroo kaan immoo kan biraa nyaata. Cimsii magaalattii dhaʼiitii balleessi.’ Waan kanas Yooʼaabin jajjabeessuuf jedhi” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Niitiin Uuriyaa yommuu akka dhirsi ishee duʼe dhageessetti ni boosseef. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Erga yeroon booʼichaa darbee booddee Daawud mana ofii isaatti ishee fudhate; isheenis niitii isaa taatee ilma deesseef. Garuu wanni Daawud hojjete sun Rabbii Allaah hin gammachiisne.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Naataan Daawudin Ifate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 11:1">11:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:29-31">12:29‑31</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1Sn 20:1‑3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Rabbii Allaahanis Naataanin gara Daawuditti erge. Innis gara Daawud dhufee akkana jedhe; “Namoota lamatu magaalaa tokko keessa jiraata ture; inni tokko sooressa, kaan immoo hiyyeessa ture. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Namichi sooressi sun hoolotaa fi loon akka malee baayʼee qaba ture; <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />namichi hiyyeessi sun garuu goromtii hoolaa kan bitate xinnoo tokko malee homaa hin qabu ture; innis goromtii hoolaa sana ni kunuunse; hoolaan sunis isaa fi ijoollee isaa biratti guddatte. Isheen nyaata isaa irraa nyaachaa, dhugaatii isaa irraa dhugaa, bobaa isaa jala ciisaa turte. Goromtiin hoolaa kun isaaf akkuma intala isaa turte.<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />“Gaaf tokko keessummaan tokko mana namicha sooressa sanaa dhufe; namichi sooressi sunis hoolota yookaan loon ofii isaa keessaa tokko fuudhee keessummichaaf nyaata qopheessuu mararsiifate. Qooda kanaa ilmoo hoolaa namicha hiyyeessa sanaa fuudhee keessummaa mana isaa dhufe sanaaf qopheesse.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daawudis namicha sanatti akka malee aaree Naataaniin akkana jedhe; “Dhugaa Rabbii Allaah jiraataa, namichi waan kana godhe sun duʼuu qaba! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Namichi sun qooda hoolaa sanaa harka afur baasuu qaba; inni gara laafina malee waan kana godheeraatii.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Naataanis Daawudiin akkana jedhe; “Namichi sun suma! Rabbii Allaahan Israaʼel akkana jedha: ‘Ani Israaʼel irratti mootii godhee si dibeera; harka Saaʼol jalaas si baaseera. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Ani mana gooftaa keetii siif kenneera; niitota gooftaa keetii illee bobaa keetti siif kenneera. Ani mana Israaʼelii fi mana Yihuudaa siif kenneera. Utuu kunneen hundi sitti xinnaatanii silaa kana caalaa iyyuu siifin kenna ture. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ati maaliif waan ija isaa duratti hamaa taʼe hojjechuudhaan dubbii Rabbii Allaah tuffatte? Ati Uuriyaa namicha Heet sana goraadeen ajjeeftee niitii isaa fudhatteerta. Ati goraadee Amoonotaatiin isa ajjeefte. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Kanaafuu amma sababii ati na tuffattee niitii Uuriyaa namicha Heet sana ofii keetiif fudhatteef goraadeen mana kee irraa hin fagaatu.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“Rabbii Allaahan akkana jedha: ‘Kunoo, ani manuma kee keessaa waan hamaa sitti nan kaasa; utuma iji kee arguu niitota kee fuudhee fira sitti aanuuf nan kenna; innis guyyuma saafaadhaan isaan wajjin ni ciisa. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Ati dhoksaatti akkas goote; ani garuu Israaʼeloota hunda duratti guyyuma saafaadhaan waan kana nan godha.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Kana irratti Daawud Naataaniin, “Ani Rabbii Allaahatti cubbuu hojjedheera” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Naataan immoo deebisee akkana jedhe; “Rabbii Allaahan cubbuu kee sirraa haqeera; atis hin duutu. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Taʼus sababii ati waan kana gochuudhaan Rabbii Allaah tuffatteef daaʼimni siif dhalate sun ni duʼa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Erga Naataan gara mana ofii isaa deemee booddee Rabbii Allaahan daaʼima niitiin Uuriyaa Daawudiif deesse ni dhaʼe; mucichis ni dhibame. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daawudis daaʼima sanaaf Allaah kadhate. Innis soomee mana isaatti galee halkan hunda lafa rafaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Maanguddoonni mana isaas lafaa isa kaasuuf isa bira dhadhaabatan; inni garuu ni dide; isaan wajjinis homaa hin nyaanne.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Daaʼimni sunis guyyaa torbaffaatti ni duʼe. Tajaajiltoonni Daawud akka daaʼimni sun duʼe isatti himuu sodaatan; isaan, “Nu yeroo daaʼimni sun lubbuun jirutti Daawuditti dubbannee ture; inni garuu nu dhagaʼuu dide. Amma akkamiin daaʼimni sun duʼeera jennee itti himna? Yoo nu itti himne inni of miidha taʼa” jedhanii yaadanii turaniitii.<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daawud akka tajaajiltoonni isaa walitti asaasaa jiran hubatee daaʼimni sun duʼuu isaa beeke. Innis, “Mucichi ni duʼee?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Isaanis, “Eeyyee duʼeera” jedhanii deebisan.<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Daawudis lafaa kaʼe. Erga dhagna isaa dhiqatee dibatee booddees uffata isaa geeddaratee mana Rabbii Allaah seenee waaqeffate. Ergasii immoo gara mana ofii isaatti galee nyaata gaafannaan dhiʼeessaniif; innis ni nyaate.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Tajaajiltoonni isaas, “Ati maaliif akkana goota? Yeroo mucichi lubbuun jirutti ni soomte; ni boosses. Amma garuu mucichi duʼeera; ati immoo kaatee nyaatta!” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Innis akkana jedhee deebise; “Ani yeroo mucichi lubbuun turetti nan soome; nan booʼes. Ani, ‘Eenyutu beeka? Rabbii Allaahan garaa naa laafee mucichi ni fayya’ jedhee yaadeen ture. <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Amma garuu inni duʼeera; yoos ani maaliifin sooma? Ani isa deebisuu nan dandaʼaa? Anatu gara isaa dhaqa malee inni gara koo hin dhufu!”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Ergasiis Daawud niitii isaa Batisheebaa ni jajjabeesse; dhaqees ishee wajjin ciise. Isheenis ilma deesseef; maqaa isaas Suleyimaan jedhanii moggaasan. Rabbii Allaahanis isa ni jaallate; <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Rabbii Allaahan waan isa jaallateef akka inni Yidiidiyaa jedhamee waamamuuf karaa Naataan nabiiʼiyyichaatiin dubbii erge.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Yeroo sanattis Yooʼaab magaalaa Amoonotaa kan Rabbaa jedhamu waraanee daʼannoo masaraa mootummaa qabate. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yooʼaabis akkana jedhee Daawuditti ergamoota erge; “Ani magaalaa Rabbaa waraanee madda bishaan ishee qabadheera. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Egaa ati loltoota hafan walitti qabadhuutii magaalattii marsii qabadhu. Yoo kanaa achii ani magaalattii nan fudhadha; isheenis maqaa kootiin moggaafamti.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Kanaafuu Daawud loltoota hunda walitti qabatee dhaqee Rabbaa waraanee qabate. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Daawudis mataa mootii isaanii irraa gonfoo fudhate; Gonfichis mataa Daawud irra kaaʼame. Gonfoon sun hamma warqee taalaantii tokkoo ulfaatee dhagaawwan gati jabeeyyiis of irraa qaba ture. Daawudis magaalaa sana keessaa boojuu akka malee baayʼee fudhatee <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />namoota achi keessa turanis gad yaasee akka isaan magaaziidhaan, gasoo sibiilaatii fi qottoodhaan hojii hojjetan godhe; suphees isaan dhoofsise. Daawud magaalaawwan Amoonotaa hunda keessattis akkasuma godhe. Ergasii Daawudii fi loltoonni isaa hundinuu Yerusaalemitti ni deebiʼan.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amnoonii fi Taamaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Yeroo tokko Amnoon ilmi Daawud Taamaarin jaallate; isheen akka malee bareedduu, obboleettii Abesaaloom ilma Daawud sanaa turte.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnoon sababii jaalala obboleettii isaa Taamaariitiif akka malee dhiphatee dhibame; sababii isheen durba turteef Amnoon waan waanuma tokko illee ishee gochuu dandaʼu hin seene.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Amnoon michuu akka malee jalʼaa kan Yoonaadaab jedhamu tokko qaba ture; Yoonaadaab ilma Shimeʼaa obboleessa Daawud. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yoonaadaabis Amnooniin, “Yaa ilma mootii, dhagni kee maaliif guyyuma guyyaan huqqachaa deema? Ati natti hin himtuu?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnoon immoo, “Ani Taamaar obboleettii Abesaaloom obboleessa kootii jaalladheera” isaan jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yehoonaadaabis, “Sobiitii akka nama dhukkubsateetti siree irra ciisi; yommuu abbaan kee si gaafachuu dhufutti, ‘Akka ani harka isheetii nyaadhuuf akka obboleettiin koo Taamaar dhuftee fuula koo duratti nyaata naa qopheessitu nan barbaada’ jedhiin” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Kanaafuu Amnoon sobee akka nama dhukkubsate tokkootti ciise. Yommuu mootichi isa gaafachuu dhufettis Amnoon, “Akka obboleettiin koo Taamaar dhuftee fuula koo duratti nyaata addaa naaf qopheessitee nyaadhu nan barbaada” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Daawudis gara manaatti Taamaaritti nama ergee, “Gara mana obboleessa kee Amnoon dhaqiitii waan inni nyaatu qopheessiif” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Kanaafuu Taamaar kaatee gara mana obboleessa ishee Amnoon kan ciisee ture sanaa dhaqxe. Daakuu xinnoo ishee fuutee bukeessitee fuula isaa duratti tolchite. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Ergasiis buddeena tolchite sana eelee irraa fuutee dhiʼeessiteef; inni garuu nyaachuu dide.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amnoon, “Nama hunda narraa baasaa” jedhe. Kanaafuu namni hundi isa biraa baʼe. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ergasiis Amnoon Taamaariin, “Akka ani harka kee irraa nyaadhuuf buddeenicha kutaa ani ciisutti naa fidi” jedhe. Taamaaris buddeena qopheessite sana fuutee Amnoon obboleessa isheetiif lafa inni ciisetti geessite. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Inni garuu yommuu isheen nyaata dhiʼeessiteefitti humnaan ishee qabatee, “Yaa obboleettii ko, kottuu na wajjin ciisi” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Isheen immoo deebiftee akkana jetteen; “Yaa obboleessa ko, waan kana hin godhin! Na hin dirqisiisin. Wanni fokkisaan akkasii Israaʼel keessatti hojjetamuu hin qabu! Ati waan hamaa kana hin godhin. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Ani maalan taʼa? Salphina koos baadhee eessan dhaqa? Ati hoo? Atis Israaʼel keessatti akka gowwaa hamaa tokkootti ilaalamuu kee ti mitii? Maaloo mootichatti himadhu; inni sitti heerumuu na hin dhowwuutii.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Inni garuu ishee dhagaʼuu dide; waan ishee caalaa jabaa taʼeefis humnaan ishee gudeede.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ergasii Amnoon jibba guddaa ishee jibbe; dhugumaan hamma dur ishee jaallate caalaa ishee jibbe. Amnoonis, “Kaʼiitii baʼii deemi!” isheen jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Isheen immoo, “Hin taʼu! Na ariʼuun kee yakka ati duraan natti hojjette caalaa hammaata” jetteen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Inni garuu ishee dhagaʼuu dide. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Tajaajilaa ofii isaas waamee, “Dubartii kana narraa baasiitii balbala itti cufi” jedheen. <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Tajaajilaan isaa sunis gad ishee baasee balbala itti cufe. Isheen uffata faaya adda addaatiin miidhagfame uffattee turte; intallan mootii kanneen dubarran qulqulluu taʼan uffata akkasii uffatu tureetii. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Taamaaris mataa isheetti daaraa firfirfattee wandaboo ishee dheeraa faayawwaniin miidhagfame sana tarsaafte. Harka ishees mataa irra kaaʼattee sagalee ol fudhattee booʼaa deemte.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Abesaaloom obboleessi ishee, “Amnoon obboleessi kee si wajjin turee? Yaa obboleettii ko, calʼisi; inni obboleessuma kee ti. Waan kana garaatti hin qabatin” jedheen. Taamaaris kophaa ishee mana obboleessa ishee mana Abesaaloom jiraatte.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Daawud mootichi yommuu waan kana hunda dhagaʼetti baayʼee aare. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abesaaloom dubbii tolaa yookaan hamaa tokko illee Amnoonitti hin dubbanne; Abesaaloom sababii inni obboleettii isaa Taamaarin salphiseef akka malee Amnoonin jibbee ture.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abesaaloom Amnoonin Ajjeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Waggaa lamaa booddee warri hoolota Abesaaloom irraa rifeensa haadan magaalaa Baʼaal Hasoor kan Efreem biratti argamu sana keessa turan; innis akka isaan achi dhaqaniif ilmaan mootii hunda waame. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abesaaloomis gara mootichaa dhaqee, “Namoonni hoolota garbicha keetii irraa rifeensa haadan dhufaniiru. Maaloo mootichii fi qondaaltonni isaa garbicha kee wajjin haa deeman” jedhee kadhate.<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mootichi immoo deebisee, “Lakki yaa ilma ko, nu hundinuu deemuu hin qabnu; nu baʼaa qofa sitti taanaa” jedheen. Abesaaloom jabeessee isa kadhatu iyyuu inni isa eebbise malee isa faana hin deemne.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Abesaaloomis, “Yoo taʼuu baate, maaloo obboleessi koo Amnoon nu wajjin haa deemu” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Mootichi immoo, “Inni maaliif si wajjin deema?” jedhee gaafate. <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Abesaaloom garuu jabeessee isa kadhate; kanaafuu inni Amnoonii fi ilmaan mootichaa kaan isa wajjin erge.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abesaaloom akkana jedhee namoota isaa ajaje; “Dhagaʼaa! Yommuu Amnoon daadhii wayinii dhugee machaaʼutti ani, ‘Amnoonin dhaʼaa’ isiniin jedha; isinis yommuu suma isa ajjeesaa. Hin sodaatinaa. Anatu ajaja kana isinii kenne mitii? Jabaadhaa; jagnoomaas.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Kanaafuu namoonni Abesaaloom waanuma Abesaaloom isaan ajaje sana Amnoonitti hojjetan. Ilmaan mootichaa hundinuus kaʼanii gaangolii isaanii yaabbatanii baqatan.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Utuu isaan karaa irra jiranuu oduun, “Abesaaloom ilmaan mootichaa hunda fixeera; tokkoon isaanii iyyuu hin hafne” jedhu Daawud qaqqabe. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Mootichis ol kaʼee uffata isaa tarsaasee lafa ciise; tajaajiltoonni isaa kanneen isa bira dhadhaabatanii turan hundinuus uffata isaanii tatarsaasan.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Yoonaadaab ilmi Shimeʼaa ilmi obboleessa Daawud sun garuu akkana jedhe; “Gooftaan koo waan isaan ilmaan mootichaa hunda fixan hin seʼin; Amnoon qofatu duʼe. Kunis waan Abesaaloom erga Amnoon obboleettii isaa Taamaarin humnaan gudeedee jalqabee itti yaadaa turee dha. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Gooftaan koo mootichi waaʼee oduu ilmaan mootichaa hundi ajjeefamaniiru jedhu sanaa hin yaaddaʼin; Amnoon qofatu duʼe.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Yeroo kanatti Abesaaloom baqateera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Namichi eegumsaaf dhaabatee tures ol jedhee ilaalee namoota baayʼee daandii Horonaayim kan gaara cina baʼu irra dhufaa jiran arge. Namichi sunis dhaqee, “Ani karaa Horonaayim, cina gaaraatti namoota nan arga” jedhee mootichatti hime.<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yoonaadaabis mootichaan, “Kunoo, ilmaan mootichaa dhufanii jiru; wanni kun akkuma garbichi kee jedhe taʼe” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Akkuma inni dubbatee fixateen ilmaan mootichaa sagalee guddaadhaan booʼaa ol galan. Mootichii fi tajaajiltoonni isaa hundinuus hiqqifatanii booʼan.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Abesaaloom garuu baqatee gara ilma Amiihuud, gara Talmaay mooticha Geshuur sanaa dhaqe. Daawud immoo guyyaa hunda ilma isaatiif ni booʼa ture.<verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abesaaloom erga baqatee Geshuur dhaqee booddee waggaa sadii achi ture. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Mootichis duʼa Amnoon irraa jajjabaannaan gara Abesaaloom dhaquuf garaan isaa kakaʼe.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abesaaloom Yerusaalemitti Deebiʼe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yooʼaab ilmi Zeruuyaa akka garaan mootichaa Abesaaloomitti deebiʼe beeke. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaab gara Teqooʼaatti nama ergee dubartii ogeettii tokko fichisiise. Innis akkana isheedhaan jedhe; “Sobiitii akka nama gadda keessa jiruu taʼi. Wayyaa gaddaa uffadhu; dibata kam iyyuu hin dibatin. Akka dubartii nama duʼe tokkoof guyyaa hedduu gaddite tokkoos taʼi. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Mooticha bira dhaqiitii waan kana itti himi.” Yooʼaabis waan isheen dubbattu isheetti hime.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Dubartiin sun yommuu Teqooʼaadhaa gara mootichaa dhuftetti ulfina isaaf kennuuf addaan lafatti gombifamtee, “Yaa mootii, na gargaari!” jette.<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mootichis, “Ati maal rakkatte?” jedhee ishee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Isheenis akkana jette; “Sababii dhirsi koo duʼeef ani dhugumaan niitii dhirsa hin qabnee dha. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Ani garbittiin kee ilmaan lama qaban ture. Isaanis alatti wal lolan; sababii namni wal irraa isaan dhowwu tokko iyyuu achi hin turiniif inni tokko isa kaan dhaʼee ajjeese. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Kunoo, gosti hundi ana garbittii keetti kaʼeera; isaanis, ‘Waan inni obboleessa ofii isaa ajjeeseef akka nu sababii lubbuu obboleessa isaa kan inni ajjeese sanaa isa ajjeefnuuf dabarsii nutti kenni; ergasii dhaaltuu isaa illee ni galaafanna’ jedhu. Isaanis akkasiin akka dhirsi koo maqaa yookaan sanyii lafa irraa hin qabaanneef ibsaa koo tokkicha hafe kana dhaamsu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Mootichis dubartii sanaan, “Ani waaʼee keetiif ajaja nan dabarsaatii ati mana keetti gali” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Dubartiin Teqooʼaa sun garuu, “Yaa gooftaa ko, yaa mooticha, yakki sun anaa fi maatii abbaa koo irra haa buʼu; mootichii fi teessoon isaa yakka irraa haa qulqullaaʼan” jette.<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mootichis deebisee, “Yoo namni kam iyyuu waan tokko illee sitti dubbate isa natti fidi; innis deebiʼee si hin rakkisu” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Ishee immoo, “Kanaafuu akka namni haaloo dhiigaa baasu sun ittuma fufee nama biraa ajjeesee akkasiin ilmi koo hin ajjeefamneef mootichi Rabbii Allaah, Allaah isaa haa waammatu” jette.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Innis, “Dhugaa Rabbii Allaah jiraataa, rifeensi tokkittiin mataa ilma keetii irraa lafa hin buʼu” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Ergasiis dubartittiin, “Akka ani garbittiin kee gooftaa koo mootichatti dubbii tokkittii dubbadhu naa eeyyami” jette.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Innis, “Dubbadhu” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Dubartittiin immoo akkana jette; “Yoos ati maaliif waan akkasii saba Allaahatti yaadde? Mootichi ilma isaa kan biyyaa baqate sana hin deebifneetii; akkana jechuun isaa ofitti muruu isaa mitii? <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Nus akkuma bishaan lafatti dhangalaʼee deebiʼee hin waraabamneetti ni duuna. Allaahan garuu karaa namni biyyaa baqate sun ittiin deebiʼu barbaada malee akka inni isa irraa fagaatee hafu hin fedhu.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />“Kanaafuu sababii namoonni na sodaachisaniif ani dubbii kana gooftaa koo mootichatti himuuf dhufeera. Garbittiin kees waan kana yaadde; ‘Ani mooticha nan gaafadha; innis waan garbittiin isaa gaafatte tole jedha taʼa. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Mootichi waan kana dhagaʼee harka namicha anaa fi ilma koo dhaala Allaahan nuu kenne nu dhabsiisuu yaaluu jalaa garbittii isaa ni baasaatii.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />“Ammas garbittiin kee akkana jetti; ‘Sababii gooftaan koo mootichi waan gaarii fi hamaa gargari baasee beekuutti akkuma malaʼikkaa Allaaha taʼeef dubbiin gooftaa koo mootichaa boqonnaa naaf haa kennu. Rabbii Allaahan kee si wajjin haa taʼu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Kana irratti mootichi dubartittiidhaan, “Ati waan ani si gaafadhu kam iyyuu na hin dhoksin” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Dubartittiinis, “Gooftaan koo mootichi haa dubbatu” jette.<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Mootichi, “Waan kana hunda keessatti harki Yooʼaab si wajjin jiraa?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Dubartiin sun immoo akkana jettee deebifte; “Yaa gooftaa koo mooticha, duʼa kee ti; dubbii gooftaan koo mootichi dubbatu irraa namni gara mirgaatti yookaan gara bitaatti goruu dandaʼu tokko illee hin jiru. Dhuguma namni akka ani waan kana dubbadhu na ajajee fi kan dubbii kana hundas afaan garbittii keetii keessa kaaʼe Yooʼaabuma garbicha kee ti. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yooʼaab garbichi kee waan kana gochuun isaa haala yeroo ammaa jiru geeddaruuf. Gooftaan koo ogummaa akkuma ogummaa malaʼikkaa Allaaha qaba; inni waan lafa irratti taʼu hunda ni beeka.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Mootichis Yooʼaabiin, “Tole; ani waan kana nan godha. Ati dhaqii Abesaaloom dargaggeessicha fidi” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yooʼaabis ulfina isaaf kennuuf addaan gombifamee mooticha eebbise. Yooʼaab, “Sababii mootichi duʼaa garbicha isaa dhagaʼeef inni akka fuula gooftaa isaa mootichaa duratti fudhatama argate harʼa ni beeka” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ergasii Yooʼaab Geshuur dhaqee Abesaaloomin deebisee Yerusaalemitti fide. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Mootichi garuu, “Inni gara mana isaa deemuu qaba; inni fuula koo arguu hin qabu” jedhe. Kanaafuu Abesaaloom gara mana isaatti gale; fuula mootichaas hin argine.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Guutummaa Israaʼel keessa namni akka Abesaaloom miidhaguma isaatiin baayʼee jajame tokko iyyuu hin turre. Inni mataa isaatii jalqabee hamma faana miilla isaatti hirʼina tokko iyyuu hin qabu ture. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Yommuu rifeensi mataa isaa itti ulfaatutti waggaatti yeroo tokko of irraa mura ture; yeroo inni rifeensa mataa isaa kana madaalli mootiitiin madaaluttis rifeensi isaa saqilii dhibba lama ulfaata ture.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abesaaloom ilmaan sadii fi intala tokko dhalche. Maqaan intala sanaa Taamaar jedhama; isheenis dubartii akka malee bareeddu turte.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abesaaloom utuu fuula mootichaa hin argin waggaa lama Yerusaalem keessa jiraate. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ergasii Abesaaloom Yooʼaabin gara mootichaatti erguuf jedhee nama itti erge; Yooʼaab garuu isa bira dhufuu dide. Kanaafuu yeroo lammaffaa nama itti erge; inni garuu dhufuu dide. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ergasiis Abesaaloom hojjettoota isaatiin, “Ilaa, lafti qotiisaa Yooʼaab lafa qotiisaa kootti aana; innis garbuu achii qaba. Dhaqaatii ibidda itti qabsiisaa” jedhe. Kanaafuu hojjettoonni Abesaaloom dhaqanii lafa qotiisaa sanatti ibidda qabsiisan.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Kana irratti Yooʼaab gara mana Abesaaloom dhaqee, “Hojjettoonni kee maaliif lafa qotiisaa kootti ibidda qabsiisan?” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abesaaloomis deebisee Yooʼaabiin akkana jedhe; “Kunoo ani akka ati, ‘Inni, “Ani maaliifin Geshuurii dhufe? Utuun hamma ammaatti achuma jiraadhee naaf wayya ture!” jedha’ jettee mootichatti naaf himtuuf gara mootichaatti si ergachuuf, na bira kottu jedhee sitti dhaammadheen ture. Ani amma illee fuula mootichaa arguun fedha; yoo ani yakka tokko illee hojjedhee jiraadhe inni na haa ajjeesu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Kanaafuu Yooʼaab gara mootichaa dhaqee waan kana itti hime. Mootichis Abesaaloomin waamsise; innis dhufee fuula mootichaa duratti addaan lafatti gombifame. Mootichis Abesaaloomin dhungate.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Fincila Abesaaloom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Kana irratti Abesaaloom gaarii lolaatii fi fardeen akkasumas namoota fuula isaa dura fiigan shantama ofii isaatiif qopheeffate. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Innis ganamaan kaʼee daandii gara karra magaalaatti nama geessu irra dhaabata ture. Yeroo namni kam iyyuu iyyata isaa mootii duratti dhiʼeeffatee murtii argachuuf dhufutti, Abesaaloom ofitti isa waamee, “Ati magaalaa kamii dhufte?” jedhee gaafata. Namni sunis, “Garbichi kee gosoota Israaʼel keessaa gosa tokko keessaa dhufa” jedhee deebisaaf. <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Ergasiis Abesaaloom, “Kunoo iyyanni kee dhugaa fi qajeelaa dha; garuu akka inni si dhagaʼuuf namni mootiin iddoo buufate tokko iyyuu hin jiru” jedhaan. <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Abesaaloomis itti dabalee, “Maal qaba, utuu ani biyya kanatti abbaa murtii taʼee! Silaa namni iyyata yookaan himata qabu kam iyyuu na bira dhufee anis murtii qajeelaa isaaf nan kennan ture” jedha.<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Akkasumas yeroo namni tokko fuula isaa duratti jilbeenfachuuf gara isaa dhufutti Abesaaloom harka diriirfatee ol isa qabuudhaan isa dhungata. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Abesaaloom akkasiin Israaʼeloota murtii qajeelaa argachuuf gara mootii dhufan hunda simachuudhaan garaa namoota Israaʼel hate.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Abesaaloomis gara dhuma waggaa afuraffaatti mootichaan akkana jedhe; “Akka ani Kebroon dhaqee wareega Rabbii Allaahaf wareegee ture tokko dhiʼeessuuf naaf eeyyami. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Ani garbichi kee yeroon biyya Sooriyaa keessa Geshuur jiraachaa turetti, ‘Yoo Rabbii Allaahan gara Yerusaalemitti na deebise, ani Kebroonitti Rabbii Allaahaf nan sagada’ jedhee wareega kana wareegeen ture.”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Mootichis, “Nagaan deemi” jedheen. Kanaafuu Abesaaloom gara Kebroon deeme.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Abesaaloom garuu akka isaan, “Isin akkuma sagalee malakataa dhageessaniin, ‘Abesaaloom Kebroonitti mootii taʼeera’ jedhaa” jedhaniif guutummaa gosoota Israaʼel keessa dhoksaadhaan ergamoota bobbaase. <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Namoonni dhibbi lama Yerusaalemii baʼanii Abesaaloom faana buʼan. Isaan akka keessummaatti affeeramanii calʼisaniituma deeman malee waaʼee dhimma sanaa waan tokko illee quba hin qaban ture. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Abesaaloom yeroo aarsaa dhiʼeessutti namichi gosa Giiloo kan Ahiitofel jedhamu, gorsaan Daawud akka magaalaa isaa Giiloodhaa dhufuuf waamsise. Kanaafuu fincilli sun jabaatee duukaa buutonni Abesaaloomis baayʼachaa dhufan.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Baqachuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Malaʼikkaan tokkos Daawud bira dhufee, “Garaan namoota Israaʼel gara Abesaaloomitti deebiʼee jira” jedhee itti hime.<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ergasiis Daawud qondaaltota isaa warra isa wajjin Yerusaalem keessa turaniin akkana jedhe; “Kaʼaa ni baqannaa! Yoo kanaa achii tokkoon keenya iyyuu Abesaaloom jalaa hin baanu. Dafnee asii deemuu qabna; yoo kanaa achii inni ariitiidhaan dhufee nu qaqqabee nu balleessaatii; magaalattii illee goraadeedhaan dhaʼa.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Qondaaltonni mootichaas, “Nu tajaajiltoonni kee waan gooftaan keenya mootichi murteesse kam iyyuu gochuuf qophaaʼoo dha” isaan jedhan.<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Kanaafuu mootichi warra mana isaa jiraatan hunda of faana fudhatee qajeele; saajjatoowwan isaa kudhan garuu akka isaan masaraa mootii eeganiif achumatti dhiise. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Mootichis akkasiin namoota hunda of faana fudhatee baʼe; isaanis xinnoo achi fagaatanii iddoo tokko dhadhaabatan. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Namoonni isaa hundinuu Kereetotaa fi Pheletota hunda wajjin mooticha dura qajeelan; akkasumas Gaatonni dhibba jaʼa kanneen Gitii isa faana baʼanis fuula mootichaa dura darban.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Mootichis Itaayi namicha Gitii sanaan akkana jedhe; “Ati maaliif nu faana dhufta? Deebiʼiitii Abesaaloom mooticha wajjin turi. Ati keessummaa biyya keetii boojiʼamtee dhuftee dha. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Ati kaleessuma dhufte. Egaa ani utuun ofii kootiifuu garan dhaqu hin beekin akka ati nu faana joortun si godhaa? Amma beenuu namoota biyya keetii fudhadhuutii deebiʼi. Gara laafinnii fi amanamummaan si wajjin haa taʼan.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Itaayi garuu deebisee mootichaan, “Dhugaa Rabbii Allaah jiraataatii fi duʼa gooftaa koo mootichaa, jireenyas taʼu duʼa taanaan ani tajaajilaan kee gara gooftaan koo mootichi deemu kam iyyuu nan deema” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Daawud immoo Itaayiin, “Yoos darbii fuula duratti deemi” jedhe. Kanaafuu Itaayi namichi Gitii sun namoota isaatii fi maatii isaa kanneen isa wajjin turan hunda fudhatee deeme.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Yeroo namoonni sun hundi darbanittis warri baadiyyaa jiraatan hundi sagalee ol fudhatanii booʼan. Mootichis Sulula Qeedroon ceʼee deeme; namoonni hundinuus ceʼanii gara gammoojjiitti qajeelan.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Zaadoqis achi ture; Lewwonni isa wajjin turan hundinuu taabota kakuu Allaaha baatanii turan; isaanis taabota Allaaha lafa kaaʼan; Abiyaataar immoo hamma namoonni hundi magaalaa keessaa baʼanitti aarsaa dhiʼeesse.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ergasii mootichi Zaadoqiin akkana jedhe; “Ati taabota Allaaha fuudhiitii gara magaalaatti deebiʼi. Yoo ani fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti surraa argadhee jiraadhe, inni deebisee na fidee taabota sanaa fi lafa ofii jiraatu na argisiisa. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Garuu yoo inni, ‘Ani sitti hin gammanne’ naan jedhe, ani qophaaʼaa dha; inni waan fedhe na haa godhu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Mootichis Zaadoq lubichaan, “Ati nama mulʼataan waa argu mitii? Egaa ilma kee Ahiimaʼazin akkasumas Yoonaataan ilma Abiyaataar fudhadhuutii nagaan gara magaalaatti deebiʼi. Atii fi Abiyaataar ilmaan keessan lamaan fudhadhaatii deemaa. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Ani immoo hamman dhaamsa kee dhagaʼutti malkaa gammoojjii keessaa bira nan tura.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Kanaafuu Zaadoqii fi Abiyaataar taabota Allaaha sana fuudhanii Yerusaalemitti deebiʼanii achuma turan.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Daawud garuu Gaara Ejersaatti ol baʼe; yeroo ol baʼuttis booʼaa deemaa ture; innis mataa isaa haguuggatee kophee malee deema ture. Namoonni isa wajjin turan hundinuus mataa isaanii haguuggatanii booʼaa deemu turan. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Yeroo kanatti, “Ahiitofelis warra Abesaaloom wajjin fincilan keessaa tokkoo dha” jedhamee Daawuditti himame. Kanaafuu Daawud, “Rabbii Allaah, gorsa Ahiitofel sana jalaa busheessi” jedhee Allaah duratti duʼaa godhate.<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Yeroo Daawud iddoo wal gaʼii iddoo itti namoonni Allaah waaqeffatan gaʼettis Huushaayi namichi gosa Arkii sun wandaboo ofii tarsaasee daaraa mataatti firfirfatee isa simachuuf baʼe. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daawudis akkana jedheen, “Ati yoo na wajjin deemte baʼaa natti taata. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Garuu yoo gara magaalaatti deebitee Abesaaloomiin, ‘Yaa mootii, ani duraan garbicha abbaa keetiin ture; amma garuu garbicha kee nan taʼa’ jettee gorsa Ahiitofel busheessite na gargaaruu dandeessa. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Zaadoqii fi Abiyaataar luboonni suma wajjin achi jiraatu mitii? Ati waan masaraa mootiitii dhageessu hunda isaanitti himi. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Ilmaan isaanii lamaan Ahiimaʼaz ilmi Zaadoqii fi Yoonaataan ilmi Abiyaataar isaanuma wajjin achi jiraatan. Ati waan dhageessu hunda harka isaaniitiin naa ergi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Kanaafuu Huushaayi michuun Daawud utuma Abesaaloom Yerusaalem seenaa jiruu achi gaʼe.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Daawudii fi Ziibaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daawud fiixee gaarichaa darbee xinnoo erga deemee booddee Ziibaan tajaajilaan Mefiibooshet harroota lamatti buddeena dhibba lama, bixxillee ija wayinii dhibba tokko, bixxillee ija harbuu dhibba tokkoo fi daadhii wayinii qalqalloo tokko feʼee isa simachuuf itti dhufe.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Mootichis, “Kana hunda maaliif fidde?” jedhee Siibaa gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Ziibaan immoo, “Harroota akka maatiin mootichaa Yaabbataniif, buddeenaa fi bixxillee ija wayinii akka namoonni nyaataniif, daadhii wayinii immoo akka warri gammoojjii keessatti dadhaban ittiin bayyanataniif” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mootichis, “Ilmi ilma gooftaa keetii eessa jira?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Ziibaan immoo deebisee, “Inni waan, ‘Manni Israaʼel harʼa mootummaa akaakayyuu kootii naa deebisa’ jedhee yaaduuf Yerusaalem keessa jiraata” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Mootichis Ziibaadhaan, “Wanni kan Mefiibooshet taʼe hundinuu amma kan kee ti” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Ziibaanis, “Ani akkan fuula gooftaa kootii, fuula mootichaa duratti surraa argadhuuf ofi qabeen si kadhadha” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saamiin Daawudin Abaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Akkuma Daawud mootichi Bahuuriim gaʼeen namichi balbala maatii Saaʼol tokko itti dhufe. Maqaan isaas Shimeʼii ilma Geeraa ti; namichi kunis Daawudin abaaraa gad baʼe. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Innis utuma qondaaltonnii fi waardiyyoonni Daawud hundinuu mirgaa fi bitaan Daawudin marsanii jiranuu hunda isaaniitti dhagaa darbachaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimeʼiinis akkana jedhee isa abaaraa ture; “Asii baʼi; asii baʼi; ati nama dhiigaa ti; namicha hamaa nana! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Rabbii Allaahan dhiiga mana Saaʼol kan ati iddoo isaa buutee moote sanaa hundaaf gatii kee siif kenneera. Rabbii Allaahan mootummaa kee sirraa fuudhee ilma kee Abesaaloomiif kenneera. Ati sababii nama dhiigaa taateef ni badda!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Abiishaayi ilmi Zeruuyaa mootichaan, “Sareen duʼaan kun maaliif gooftaa koo mooticha abaara? Ani dhaqeen mataa isaa irraa kuta” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mootichi garuu akkana jedhe; “Yaa ilmaan Zeruuyaa, anii fi isin maal wal irraa qabna? Yoo inni sababii Rabbii Allaahan, ‘Ati Daawudin abaari’ isaan jedheef na abaare eenyutu, ‘Ati maaliif waan kana goota?’ jedhee isa gaafachuu dandaʼa?”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Ergasii Daawud Abiishaayii fi qondaaltota isaa hundaan akkana jedhe; “Ilmi koo kan gudeeda kootii baʼe iyyuu lubbuu koo balleessuu barbaada. Yoos namichi gosa Biniyaam kun hammam kana caalaa hin goone ree! Isa dhiisaa; waan Rabbii Allaahan isa ajajeef inni na haa abaaru. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Tarii Rabbii Allaahan dhiphina koo argee abaarsa ani harʼa abaaramaa jiru kana waan gaariitti naa geeddara taʼaa.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Kanaafuu Daawudii fi namoonni isaa karaa isaanii itti fufan; Shimeʼiin immoo isa abaaraa, dhagaa itti darbachaa, awwaaras itti bittinneessaa fuullee isaatiin gaara cina deemaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Mootichii fi namoonni isa wajjin turan hundi dadhabbii guddaadhaan dhufanii achitti aara galfatan.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gorsa Kusiitii fi Ahiitofel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Yeroo kanattis Abesaaloomii fi namoonni Israaʼel hundi gara Yerusaalem dhufan; Ahiitofelis isa wajjin ture. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Huushaayi namichi gosa Arkii michuun Daawud sun Abesaaloom bira dhaqee, “Yaa mootii bara baraan jiraadhu! Yaa mootii bara baraan jiraadhu!” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abesaaloomis, “Jaalalli ati michuu keetiif qabdu kanaa? Ati maaliif michuu kee wajjin hin deemne?” jedhee Huushaayin gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Huushaayi immoo Abesaaloomiin akkana jedhe; “Lakki; ani kan nama Rabbii Allaahan, sabni kunii fi namoonni Israaʼel hundi filatanii nan taʼa; isa wajjinis nan jiraadha. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Kanaa achi ani eenyun tajaajila? Ani Ilma tajaajiluu hin qabuu? Ani akkuman abbaa kee tajaajile sana siʼi illee nan tajaajila.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abesaaloomis Ahiitofeliin, “Mee nu gorsi. Nu maal gochuu qabna?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahiitofelis deebisee, “Ol seeniitii saajjatoowwan abbaa keetii kanneen inni akka isaan masaraa mootii eeganiif dhiisee biraa deeme wajjin ciisi. Ergasii Israaʼeloonni hundi akka ati abbaa kee jibbite dhagaʼanii, harki warra si wajjin jiran hundaas ni jabaataa” jedheen. <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Kanaafuu bantii manaa irra Abesaaloomiif dunkaana dhaaban; innis Israaʼeloota hunda duratti saajjatoowwan abbaa isaa wajjin ciise.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Bara sanatti gorsi Ahiitofel kennaa ture akkuma waan namni tokko Allaah gaafatuutti ilaalama ture. Akki itti Daawudis taʼu Abesaaloom gorsa Ahiitofel hunda dhagaʼaa turan kanaa dha.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahiitofelis Abesaaloomiin akkana jedhe; “Ani namoota kuma kudha lama filadhee halkanuma kana Daawudin nan ariʼa. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Anis yeroo inni dadhabee laafutti isa nan dhaʼa. Sodaa itti buusee akka namoonni isa wajjin jiran hundis baqatan nan godha. Ani mooticha qofa dhaʼee <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />namoota isaa hundas deebisee sittin fida. Duuti namicha ati barbaaddu sanaa deebiʼuu nama hundaa ti jechuu dha; ergasii namoonni hundinuu nagaan jiraatu.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Karoorri kunis Abesaaloomii fi maanguddoota Israaʼel hundatti waan gaarii fakkaate.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Abesaaloom garuu, “Mee Huushaayi namicha gosa Arkii sanas waamaatii waan inni jedhu haa dhageenyu” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Abesaaloom yeroo Huushaayi isa bira dhufetti, “Ahiitofel gorsa kana nuu kenneera. Waan inni jedhe kana haa goonuu? Yoo taʼuu baate immoo yaada kee nuu kenni” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Huushaayis deebisee Abesaaloomiin akkana jedhe; “Gorsi Ahiitofel kenne yeroo kanatti gaarii miti. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Ati abbaa keetii fi namoota isaa ni beekta; isaan loltootaa fi warra akkuma amaaketa ilmaan ishee jalaa fudhatamteetti nama sodaachisanii dha. Kana irratti abbaan kee muuxannoo waraanaa guddaa qaba; inni halkan halkan loltoota bira hin bulu. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Amma illee inni holqa keessa yookaan lafa biraa dhokatee jira taʼa. Yoo inni duraan dursee loltoota kee dhaʼe, namni waaʼee kanaa dhagaʼu kam iyyuu, ‘Loltoonni Abesaaloom duuka buʼan ni dhuman’ jedhee odeessa. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ergasii immoo sababii Israaʼeloonni hundinuu akka abbaan kee nama waraanaa taʼee fi akka warri isa wajjin jiranis jajjaboo taʼan beekaniif loltoonni ciccimoon warri onneen isaanii akka onnee leencaa taʼe sodaadhaan dhuman.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />“Egaa wanni ani si gorsu kana: Israaʼeloonni lakkoobsi isaanii akka cirracha qarqara galaanaa baayʼatu kanneen Daanii hamma Bersheebaatti argaman hundi si biratti walitti haa qabamaniitii ati isaan dura buʼii lolatti seeni. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Akkasiin lafa inni jirutti isa dhoofna; akkuma Fixeensi ganamaa lafa irra buʼuttis isa irra buuna. Innis taʼu namoonni isaa tokko iyyuu lubbuun hin hafan. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Yoo inni gara magaalaa sanaatti baqates, Israaʼeloonni hundinuu funyoo fidanii hamma dhagaan xinnaan tokko hin hafnetti magaalaa sana gara sululaatti harkifna.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abesaaloomii fi Israaʼeloonni hundinuu, “Gorsa Ahiitofel caalaa gorsa Huushaayi namicha gosa Arkii sanaatu wayya” jedhan. Rabbii Allaahan Abesaaloomitti badiisa fiduuf jedhee gorsa Ahiitofel gaarii sana faayidaa dhabsiiseeraatii.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Huushaayiis akkana jedhee Zaadoqii fi Abiyaataar lubootatti hime; “Ahiitofel, ‘Akkasii fi akkas godhaa’ jedhee Abesaaloomii fi maanguddoota Israaʼel gorsee ture; ani garuu, ‘Akkanaa fi akkana godhaa’ jedheen isaan gorse. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Amma gara Daawuditti ergamoota ergaatii, ‘Ati halkan kana holqawwan gammoojjii keessa hin bulin; utuu hin turin ceʼii deemi; yoo kanaa achii mootichii fi namoonni isa wajjin jiran hundinuu ni liqimfamtu’ jedhaa itti himaa.”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yeroo sanattis Yoonaataanii fi Ahiimaʼaz iddoo Een Roogeel jedhamu turan. Intalli xomboreen tokko dhaqxee isaanitti himti turte; isaan immoo dhaqanii Daawud mootichatti himu turan; isaan akka yeroo magaalaa seenanitti hin argamneef of eeggachaa turaniitii. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Garuu dargaggeessi tokko isaan argee Abesaaloomitti hime. Kanaafuu lamaan isaanii iyyuu dafanii achii baʼanii mana namicha Bahuuriim keessa jiraatu tokkoo seenan. Namichi kunis dallaa isaa keessaa boolla qaba ture; isaanis boolla sana keessa lixan. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Niitiin namicha sanaas afaan boollichaa gubbaa waa diriirsitee midhaan achi irra afte. Namni tokko iyyuu waan kana hin beekne.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Namoonni Abesaaloom yommuu dubartittii bira mana dhufanitti, “Ahiimaʼazii fi Yoonaataan meerre?” jedhanii gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Dubartittiinis, “Isaan laga ceʼanii deemaniiru” jettee isaaniif deebifte. Jarris barbaadanii isaan dhaban; kanaafuu Yerusaalemitti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Erga namoonni Abesaaloom deemanii booddee Ahiimaʼazii fi Yoonaataan boolla keessaa ol baʼanii Daawud mootichatti himuu dhaqan. Isaanis, “Ammuma kana kaʼiitii laga ceʼi; Ahiitofel, ‘Akkasii fi akkas godhaa’ jedhee sirratti isaan gorseeraa” jedhaniin. <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Kanaafuu Daawudii fi namoonni isaa hundi kaʼanii Yordaanosin ceʼan. Yeroo lafti bariitetti namni utuu Yordaanosin hin ceʼin hafe tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahiitofelis yommuu akka gorsi isaa fudhatama dhabe beeketti harree isaa feʼatee gara magaalaa iddoo mana jireenya isaatti qajeele. Innis erga mana isaa tottolfatee booddee of fannise. Akkasiinis duʼee qabrii abbaa isaa keessatti qabbarame.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Daawud gara Mahanayiim deeme; Abesaaloom immoo namoota Israaʼel hunda wajjin Yordaanosin ceʼe. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Abesaaloomis Amaasaa qooda Yooʼaab ajajaa loltootaa godhee muude; Amaasaan kun ilma namicha gosa Israaʼel kan Yitraa jedhamu isa Abiigayiil haadha Yooʼaab, obboleettii Zeruuyaa, intala Naaʼaash sana fuudhee ture. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Israaʼeloonnii fi Abesaaloom biyya Giliʼaad keessa qubatan.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Yommuu Daawud Mahanayiim gaʼettis, Shoobiin ilmi Naahaash namichi gosa Amoon kan Rabbaadhaa dhufe, Maakiir ilmi Amiiʼeel kan Lodebaarii dhufee fi Barzilaayiin namichi gosa Giliʼaad kan Rogeliimii dhufe <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />afata, waciitii fi miʼoota suphee irraa hojjetaman fidan. Akkasumas akka isaan nyaataniif qamadii fi garbuu, daakuu fi akaayii, baaqelaa fi misira, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />dammaa fi itittuu, hoolotaa fi baaduu aannan loon Daawudii fi namoota isaatiif fidan. Isaanis, “Namoonni lafa gammoojjiitti beelaʼaniiru, dadhabaniiru, dheebotaniirus” jedhanii turaniitii.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abesaaloom Duʼuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daawud namoota isa wajjin turan lakkaaʼee ajajjuuwwan kumaatii fi ajajjuuwwan dhibbaa muudeef. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daawudis harka sadii keessaa harka tokko ajaja Yooʼaab jalatti, harka tokko ajaja Abiishaayi obboleessa Yooʼaab ilma Zeruuyaa jalatti, harka tokko immoo ajaja Itaayii namicha Gitii jalatti hiriirsee bobbaase. Mootichis loltootaan, “Ani mataan koo dhugumaan isin wajjin nan baʼa” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Namoonni garuu akkana jedhaniin; “Ati deemuu hin qabdu; yoo nu baqachuuf dirqamne isaan waaʼee keenya dhimma hin qaban; yoo walakkaan keenyas dhumne isaaniif homaa miti; ati garuu nama akka keenyaa kuma kudhan caalta. Kanaafuu ati yoo magaalaa keessa turtee nu gargaarte wayya.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Mootichis, “Ani waan gaarii isinitti fakkaate kam iyyuu nan godha” jedhee deebise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Kanaafuu mootichi yeroo loltoonni hundi garee dhibbaatii fi garee kumaatiin qajeelanitti karra bira dhaabachaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Mootichis Yooʼaab, Abiishaayii fi Itaayiin, “Anaaf jedhaatii Abesaaloom dargaggeessichaaf garaa laafaa” jedhee ajaje. Loltoonni hundinuus ajaja Daawud waaʼee Abesaaloom ajajjootaaf kenne dhagaʼan.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Loltoonnis Israaʼelin waraanuuf dirree waraanaatti baʼan; lollis bosona Efreem keessatti kaʼe. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Achittis loltoonni Israaʼel loltoota Daawudiin dhaʼaman; hubaatiin gaafasiis akka malee guddaa ture; namoota kuma digdamatu dhume. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Lolli sunis guutummaa baadiyyaatti babalʼate; namoota goraadeen fixe caalaa kan bosonni liqimsee hambisetu baayʼata.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Abesaaloom yeroo kanatti akka tasaa namoota Daawuditti dhufe. Innis gaangoo isaa yaabbatee deemaa ture; utuma gaangoon isaa dameelee gobbuu qilxuu guddaa tokkoo jala darbaa jirtuu mataan Abesaaloom muka keessatti qabame. Innis qilleensa irratti rarraʼee hafe; gaangoon inni yaabbatee ture sun garuu deemsa ishee ittuma fufte.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Namichi tokko yommuu waan kana argetti, “Ani akka Abesaaloom muka qilxuutti rarraʼee jiru ammuma argeera” jedhee Yooʼaabitti hime.<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yooʼaabis namicha waan kana isatti himeen, “Maal jetta! Ati isa argiteertaa? Maaliif achumatti rukuttee lafaan isa dhaʼuu dhiifte? Silaa ani meetii saqilii kudhanii fi sabbata jagnummaa sin badhaasa turee” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Namichi sun garuu, akkana jedhee deebise; “Utuu saqiliin kuma tokko harka kootti naaf safaramee iyyuu ani ilma mootiitti harka koo ol hin fudhadhu. Mootichi utuu nu dhageenyuu siʼi, Abiishaayii fi Itaayiin, ‘Anaaf jedhaatii Abesaaloom dargaggeessicha eegaa’ jedhee ajajeera. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Karaa biraa immoo utuu ani kutadhee lubbuu isaa balleessee, sababii wanti mooticha duraa dhokatu tokko iyyuu hin jirreef ati mataan kee iyyuu natti hin dhiʼaattu ture.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yooʼaabis, “Kana booddee ani haala kanaan si wajjin yeroo balleessuu hin qabu” jedhe. Kanaafuu ankaasee sadii harkatti qabatee utuma Abesaaloom muka qilxuutti rarraʼee lubbuun jiruu garaa isaatti dire. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Warri Yooʼaabiif miʼa lolaa baatan kurnanis itti naannaʼanii Abesaaloomin dhaʼanii ajjeesan.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Kana irratti Yooʼaab malakata afuufe; loltoonnis sababii inni isaan dhowweef Israaʼelin ariʼuu ni dhiisan. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Isaanis reeffa Abesaaloom fuudhanii bosona keessatti boolla guddaa tokkotti darbatanii dhagaa gurguddaa isa irra tuulan. Yeroo kanatti Israaʼeloonni hundi gara mana isaaniitti baqatan.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Abesaaloom yeroo lubbuun turetti, “Ani ilma maqaa koo waamsisu hin qabu” jedhee iddoo Sulula Mootii jedhamutti yaadannoo ofiitiif soodduu dhaabbate. Soodduu sanas maqaa ofii isaatiin moggaase. Hamma harʼaatti illee soodduun sun Soodduu Abesaaloom jedhamee waamama.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gadda Daawud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Ahiimaʼaz ilmi Zaadoq, “Ani dhaqee akka Rabbii Allaahan harka diinota isaa jalaa isa baase mootichatti nan hima” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yooʼaab immoo, “Namni harʼa dhaqee himu siʼii miti; sababii ilmi mootichaa duʼeef ati yeroo biraa dhaqxee itti himta; garuu harʼa waan kana gochuu hin qabdu” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ergasiis Yooʼaab Kuushiidhaan, “Dhaqiitii waan argite mootichatti himi” jedhe. Kuushiinis fuula Yooʼaab duratti gad jedhee harka fuudhee fiigaa qajeele.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahiimaʼaz ilmi Zaadoq ammas Yooʼaabiin, “Wanni fedhe haa dhufu; maaloo anis Kuushii faana nan fiiga” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Yooʼaab garuu, “Yaa ilma ko, ati maaliif dhaquu barbaadda? Ati oduu badhaasa siif kennisiisu tokko iyyuu hin qabdu” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Inni immoo, “Wanni fedhe haa dhufu; ani fiiguu nan barbaada” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Kanaafuu Yooʼaab, “Fiigi!” jedheen. Ergasii Ahiimaʼaz karaa dirreetiin fiigee Kuushii bira darbe.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Adoo Daawud karra alaatii fi kan keessaa gidduu taaʼee jiruu eegduun karaa dhaaba gubbaa manaatiin karaatti ol baʼe. Innis achi ilaalee nama kophaa isaa fiigu tokko arge. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Eegduun sunis mooticha waamee waan kana itti hime.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Mootichis, “Inni yoo kophaa isaa taʼe, oduu gaarii fiduu qaba” jedhe. Namichi sunis dhiʼaachaa dhufe.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Ergasiis eegduun sun utuu namni biraa fiiguu argee eegduu karraa waamee, “Kunoo namni biraa tokko kophaa isaa fiigaa jira!” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Mootichis, “Innis oduu gaarii fiduu qaba” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Eegduun sunis, “Inni jalqabaa waan akka Ahiimaʼaz ilma Zaadoqitti fiigu natti fakkaata” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Mootichi immoo, “Inni nama gaarii dha; oduu gaarii fidee dhufa” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ahiimaʼaz mooticha waamee, “Wanni hundinuu gaarii dha” jedhe; fuula mootichaa durattis addaan lafatti gombifamee, “Rabbii Allaahan kee galata haa argatu; inni warra gooftaa koo mootichatti harka isaanii ol fudhatan dabarsee kenneeraatii” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Mootichi immoo, “Abesaaloom dargaggeessichi jalaa baʼeeraa?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahiimaʼazis, “Yeroo Yooʼaab garbicha mootichaatii fi ana garbicha kee erguuf kaʼetti raafama guddaatu ture. Garuu wanni sun maal akka taʼe ani hin beeku” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mootichis, “As hiiqii dhaabadhu” jedhe. Kanaafuu inni achi hiiqee dhaabate.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Ergasiis Kuushiin dhufee, “Gooftaa koo yaa mootii, oduu gammachiisaa dhagaʼi! Rabbii Allaahan harʼa warra sitti kaʼan hunda jalaa si baaseera” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Mootichis Kuushiidhaan, “Abesaaloom dargaggeessichi jalaa baʼeeraa?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Kuushiinis, “Diinonni gooftaa koo mootichaatii fi warri si miidhuuf sitti kaʼan hundi akkuma dargaggeessa sanaa haa taʼan” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Mootichi ni hollate. Kutaa manaa kan karra duraa gubbaattis ol baʼee booʼe. Yommuu ol baʼuttis, “Yaa ilma koo Abesaaloom! Ilma ko, ilma koo Abesaaloom! Utuu qooda kee ani duʼee jiraadhee; yaa Abesaaloom ilma ko, yaa ilma ko!” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yooʼaabittis, “Daawud mootichi Abesaaloomiif booʼuu fi gadduutti jira” jedhamee himame. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Sababii guutummaan loltootaa oduu, “Mootichi ilma isaatiif gaddaa jira” jedhu dhagaʼeef moʼichi gaafa sanaa gaddatti geeddarame. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Gaafa sana sabni hundis akkuma loltoota moʼatamanii qaanaʼuudhaan baqatanii magaalaa seenaniitti qaanaʼee magaalaa seene. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mootichis fuula isaa haguuggatee, “Yaa ilma koo Abesaaloom! Yaa Abesaaloom ilma ko, yaa ilma koo!” jedhee sagalee ol fudhatee booʼe.<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Yooʼaab gara mootichaa mana ol seenee akkana jedhe; “Ati harʼa fuula namoota kee kanneen lubbuu kee, lubbuu ilmaan keetiitii fi intallan keetii, lubbuu niitota keetiitii fi saajjatoowwan keetii oolchan sana hundaa qaaniidhaan haguugdeerta. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Ati warra si jibban jaallattee warra si jaallatan immoo jibbiteerta. Ati akka ajajjoota loltoota keetiitii fi namoota isaanii wayittuu hin hedne harʼa mirkaneessiteerta. Harʼa utuu hundi keenya duunee Abesaaloom jiraatee ati akka gammaddu ani nan arga. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Amma gad baʼiitii namoota kee jajjabeessi. Yoo ati gad baʼuu baatte akka edana namni tokko iyyuu si biratti hin hafne ani maqaa Rabbii Allaahatiin nan kakadha. Kun immoo rakkina ati ijoollummaa keetii jalqabdee hamma ammaatti keessa dabarte hunda caalaa hammaata.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Kanaafuu mootichi kaʼee karra dura taaʼe. Namoonni hundinuus yommuu, “Mootichi karra dura taaʼee jira” jedhamee itti himametti isa bira dhufan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Yeroo sanatti Israaʼeloonni hundi gara mana isaaniitti baqatanii turan.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Yerusaalemitti Deebiʼe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Guutummaa gosoota Israaʼel keessatti namoonni hundinuu akkana jedhanii wal falmaa turan; “Mootichi harka diinota keenyaa jalaa nu baaseera; namni harka Filisxeemotaa jalaa nu baases isuma. Amma garuu inni sababii Abesaaloomiitiif biyyaa baqateera; <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Abesaaloom inni nu akka inni bulchaa keenya taʼuuf jennee dibne sun immoo lola irratti duʼeera. Kanaafuu waaʼee mooticha as deebisuu irratti isin maaliif waan tokko hin mariʼanne?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Daawud mootichis akkana jedhee ergaa kana Zaadoqii fi Abiyaataar lubootatti erge; “Akkana jedhaatii maanguddoota Yihuudaa gaafadhaa; ‘Wanni guutummaa Israaʼel keessatti odeeffamaa jiru gurra mootichaa qaqqabeeraatii isin maaliif mooticha mana mootummaa isaatti deebisuu irratti duubatti haftani? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Isin obboloota koo, foon kootii fi dhiiga koo ti; yoos mooticha fiduu irratti maaliif duubatti harkifattan ree?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Amaasaanis, ‘Ati foonii fi dhiiga koo mitii? Yoo ani ammaa jalqabee iddoo Yooʼaab ajajaa loltoota koo si gochuu baadhe, Allaahan waan hamaa natti haa fidu; waan caalu illee natti haa fidu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Mootichis akkuma garaa nama tokkootti garaa namoota Yihuudaa hundaa boojiʼe. Isaanis, “Namoota kee hunda wajjin deebiʼi” jedhanii mootichatti ergan. <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Mootichis biyyatti deebiʼee hamma Yordaanositti dhufe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Namoonni Yihuudaas mooticha simatanii Yordaanosin ceesisanii fiduuf hamma Gilgaalitti dhufan. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimeʼiin namichi Bahuuriim ilmi Geeraa kan gosa Biniyaam sunis mooticha simachuuf namoota Yihuudaa wajjin dafee gad buʼe. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Isa wajjinis Biniyaamota kuma tokko akkasumas Ziibaa tajaajilaa maatii Saaʼol, ilmaan isaa kudha shananii fi hojjettoota isaa digdamatu ture. Isaanis mooticha dursanii Yordaanosin ceʼan. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Isaanis maatii mootichaa simachuu fi waan inni barbaadu isaaf gochuuf malkaa ceʼan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Shimeʼiin ilmi Geeraa yommuu Yordaanosin ceʼetti mooticha duratti kufee <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />akkana isaan jedhe; “Gooftaan koo balleessaa natti hin herregin. Balleessaa garbichi kee yeroo ati gooftaan koo mootichi Yerusaalemii baatetti hojjete garaatti hin qabatin. Mootichi waan sana yaada isaa keessaa haa baasu. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Ani garbichi kee cubbuu hojjechuu koo beekaatii; harʼa garuu ani mana Yuusuf hunda keessaa gooftaa koo mooticha simachuuf nama jalqabaa taʼee dhufeera.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Abiishaayi ilmi Zeruuyaas, “Shimeʼiin sababii nama Rabbii Allaahan dibe abaareef amma duʼuun isaaf hin maluu?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Daawud immoo deebisee, “Yaa ilmaan Zeruuyaa anii fi isin maal wal irraa qabna? Isin yeroo ammaa diinota natti taataniirtu! Harʼa namni tokko iyyuu Israaʼel keessatti ajjeefamuu qabaa? Ani guyyaa harʼaa Israaʼel irratti mootii taʼuu koo hin beekuu?” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Kanaafuu mootichi Shimeʼiidhaan, “Ati duʼuu hin qabdu” jedhe. Kanas kakaadhaan mirkaneesseef.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefiibooshet akaakayyuun Saaʼolis mooticha simachuuf gad buʼe. Inni gaafa mootichi Yerusaalemii baʼee jalqabee hamma mootichi deebiʼutti miilla isaatiif eegumsa barbaachisaa hin goone yookaan areeda hin haaddanne yookaan uffata isaa hin miiccanne ture. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Yeroo inni mooticha simachuuf Yerusaalemii dhufettis mootichi, “Mefiibooshet, ati maaliif na wajjin hin deemne?” jedhee isa gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Innis akkana jedhee deebise; “Yaa gooftaa koo mooticha, ani garbichi kee waanan naafa taʼeef, ‘Akka ani yaabbadhee mooticha faana deemuu dandaʼuuf harreen koo naaf haa feʼamu’ jedheen ture. Ziibaan tajaajilaan koo garuu na gowwoomse. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Inni gooftaa koo mooticha durattis garbicha kee maqaa balleesseera; gooftaan koo mootichi akkuma malaʼikkaa Allaaha ti; kanaafuu waan barbaadde hunda godhi. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Silaa wanni maatiin abbaa kootii hundinuu mooticha irraa argachuu malan duʼa qofa ture. Ati garuu ana garbicha kee warra maaddii kee irraa nyaatan wajjin teessifte. Kana caalaa wanni ani akka naa godhamuuf mooticha gaafachuuf mirga qabu maalii?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Mootichis, “Maaliif dubbii dheeressita? Ani akka atii fi Ziibaan lafa hunda gargar qooddattan ajajeera” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefiibooshet immoo mootichaan, “Amma erga gooftaan koo mootichi nagaan deebiʼee inni waan hunda haa fudhatu” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Namichi gosa Giliʼaad kan Barzilaay jedhamu tokkos Rogeliimii gad buʼe; innis mooticha geggeessuuf isa wajjin Yordaanos ceʼe. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Barzilaayiin jaarsa dulloomaa waggaa saddeettama ture. Innis waan nama sooressa tureef yeroo mootichi Mahanayiim jiraatetti waan inni nyaatu dhiʼeessaafii ture. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Mootichis Barzilaayiin, “Gamatti na wajjin ceʼiitii na wajjin Yerusaalem jiraadhu; anis sin sooraa” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Barzilaayiin garuu mootichaan akkana jedhe; “Ani siʼachi waggaa hammam jiraachuufan mooticha wajjin Yerusaalem dhaqa? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ani yeroo ammaa waggaa saddeettama guuteera. Ani waan gaarii fi waan hamaa addaan baasuu nan dandaʼaa? Garbichi kee miʼaa nyaataa fi dhugaatii beekaa? Ammas sagalee dhiirotaatii fi dubartoota sirbanii dhagaʼuu dandaʼaa? Yoos garbichi kee maaliif gooftaa koo mootichatti baʼaa dabalamaa taʼa ree? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Garbichi kee mooticha wajjin Yordaanos ceʼee xinnoo ishee ni deema; mootichi garuu maaliif haala kanaan galata naaf deebisa? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Akka ani yoon duʼe magaaluma kootti qabrii abbaa fi haadha koo biratti qabbaramuuf garbicha kee dhiisi haa deebiʼu. Garbichi kee Kimhaam garuu kunoo ti. Inni gooftaa koo mooticha wajjin haa ceʼu. Atis waan jaallattu kam iyyuu isaaf godhi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mootichis, “Kimhaam na wajjin ni ceʼa; anis waan ati jaallattu kam iyyuu isaaf nan godha; waan ati narraa barbaaddu kam iyyuus siif nan godha” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Akkasiin namoonni hundinuu Yordaanosin ceʼan; mootichis ni ceʼe. Mootichis Barzilaayii dhungatee eebbise; Barzilaayiinis gara mana isaatti deebiʼe.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Yommuu mootichi gara Gilgaalitti darbetti Kimhaam isa wajjin deeme. Loltoonni Yihuudaa hundinuu fi walakkaan loltoota Israaʼel mooticha ceesisan.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Yommuu suma namoonni Israaʼel hundinuu gara mootichaa dhufanii, “Obboloonni keenya warri Yihuudaa maaliif nu dhoksanii mootichaa fi maatii isaa, duukaa buutota isa wajjin Yordaanosin ceesisanii fidani?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Namoonni Yihuudaa hundis deebisanii namoota Israaʼeliin, “Nu waan mootichi fira dhiigaa nuuf taʼeef waan kana goone. Isin waaʼee waan kanaa maaliif aartu? Nu waan mootichaa keessaa tokko illee nyaanneerraa? Waan tokko illees ofii keenyaaf fudhanneerraa?” jedhan.<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Kana irratti namoonni Israaʼel namoota Yihuudaatiin, “Nu mooticha irraa qooda harka kudhan qabna; kana malees nu isin caalaa Daawud irraa mirga qabna. Yoos isin maaliif akkas nu tuffattu ree? Akka mootiin keenya nuuf deebiʼuuf kan duraan dursinee gaafanne nu mitii?” jedhanii deebisan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Garuu deebiin namoonni Yihuudaa deebisan kan Israaʼelootaa irra jabaa ture.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Saabeʼeen Daawuditti Finciluu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Yeroo kanatti namichi dabaan Shebaa jedhamu, ilmi Biikrii namicha gosa Biniyaam tokko achi ture. Innis malakata afuufee sagalee guddaan akkana jedhee iyye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Nu Daawud irraa qooda hin qabnu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">ilma Isseey irraa dhaala tokko illee hin qabnu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">Yaa Israaʼel, tokkoon tokkoon namaa gara dunkaana isaatti!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Kanaafuu namoonni Israaʼel hundinuu Shebaa ilma Biikrii sana duukaa buʼuuf jedhanii Daawud irraa garagalan. Namoonni Yihuudaa garuu Yordaanosii hamma Yerusaalemitti mootii isaanii wajjin deeman.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Daawudis yommuu masaraa isaa kan Yerusaalem keessaatti deebiʼetti, saajjatoowwan isaa kurnan akka isaan masaraa eeganiif dhiisee biraa deeme sana fuudhee mana tokkotti galchee akka isaan eegaman godhe. Inni waan isaan nyaatan kenneef malee isaan wajjin hin ciifne. Isaanis hamma gaafa duʼaniitti akka niitota dhirsoonni irraa duʼaniitti kophaa jiraatan.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Ergasiis mootichi Amaasaadhaan, “Namoota Yihuudaa guyyaa sadii keessatti walitti naa qabi; atis asitti argami” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Amaasaan garuu yommuu namoota Yihuudaa waamuu deemetti yeroo mootichi isaaf kenne caalaa ture.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daawudis Abiishaayidhaan, “Shebaan ilmi Biikrii miidhaa Abesaaloom nu miidhe sana caalaa nu miidha. Ati namoota gooftaa keetii fudhadhuutii isa ariʼi; yoo kanaa achii inni magaalaa daʼannoo qabu argatee nu jalaa miliqa” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Kanaafuu namoonni Yooʼaabii fi Kereetonni, Pheletonnii fi namoonni waraanaa jajjaboon hundi ajaja Abiishaayi jalatti hiriiranii qajeelan. Isaanis Yerusaalemii kaʼanii Shebaa ilma Biikrii sana ariʼuuf qajeelan.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Utuma isaan Gibeʼoon keessa kattaa guddaa bira jiranuu Amaasaan isaan simachuuf dhufe. Yooʼaab uffata isaa kan waraanaa uffate; qalqalli goraadeen isaa keessa jirus sabbataan mudhii isaatti hidhamee ture. Akkuma inni gara fuula duraatti tarkaanfateenis goraadichi qalqala isaa keessaa lafa buʼe.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yooʼaabis Amaasaan, “Yaa obboleessoo, akkam jirta?” jedhe. Kana irratti Yooʼaab isa dhungachuuf harka isaa mirgaatiin hareeda Amesaay qabate. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amesaay akka Yooʼaab goraadee harkaa qabu hin hubanne ture; kanaafuu Yooʼaab goraadee sana garaa isaatti dire; marʼumaan isaas lafatti jige. Amaasaanis utuu lammata hin waraanamin duʼe. Ergasii immoo Yooʼaabii fi obboleessi isaa Abiishaayi Shebaa ilma Biikrii sana ariʼan.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Namoota Yooʼaab keessaa inni tokko Amesaay bira dhaabatee, “Namni Yooʼaabin jaallatu, kan garee Daawud taʼe hundi Yooʼaabin duukaa haa buʼu!” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Yeroo kanatti reeffi Amaasaa dhiigaan faalamee karaa irra ciisa ture; namichi tokkos akka loltoonni hundi achi dhadhaabatan arge. Innis yommuu akka warri gara Amesaay dhufan hundi dhadhaabatan argetti karaa irraa gara lafa qotiisaatti isa harkisee wayyaa irra buuse. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Erga reeffi Amesaay karaa irraa kaafamee booddee namoonni hundinuu Shebaa ilma Biikrii sana ariʼuuf Yooʼaab faana qajeelan.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Saabeʼeenis gosoota Israaʼel hunda keessa darbee gara Abeel Beet Maʼaakaatii fi gara biyya Beeriit hundaa dhaqe; namoonni Beeriitis walitti qabamanii isa duukaa buʼan. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Loltoonni Yooʼaab wajjin turan hundinuus dhufanii Abeel Beet Maʼaakaatti Saabeʼee marsan. Isaanis hamma karra magaalaa sanaatti naannessanii biyyoo tuulan; yommuu dallaa magaalaa sanaa jigsuuf tumaa turanittis, <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />dubartiin ogeettiin tokko magaalattiidhaa isaan waamtee, “Dhagaʼaa! Dhagaʼaa! Akka ani waa isatti himuu dandaʼuuf Yooʼaab as haa dhufu itti himaa” jette. <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Inni gara ishee dhaqe; isheenis, “Ati Yooʼaabii?” jettee gaafatte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Innis, “Ani isuma” jedhee deebise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Isheen immoo, “Waan tajaajiltuun kee dubbattu dhagaʼi” jette.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Innis, “Ani dhagaʼaan jira.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Isheenis itti fuftee akkana jette; “Bara durii namoonni, ‘Gara Abeel dhaqaa gorsa gaafadhaa’ jedhu ture; akkasiinis dubbiin ni dhuma ture. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Ani warra Israaʼel keessa nagaa fi amanamummaan jiraatan keessaa tokkoo dha. Ati magaalaa Israaʼel keessatti haadha taate tokko balleessuuf yaadaa jirta. Ati maaliif dhaala Rabbii Allaah liqimsuu barbaadda?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yooʼaab immoo akkana jedhee deebise; “Wanni kun narraa haa fagaatu! Magaalattii balleessuun yookaan liqimsuun narraa haa fagaatu! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Wanni kun akkana miti. Namichi Shebaa jedhamu ilmi Biikrii kan biyya gaaraa Efreem sun mootiitti, Daawuditti harka isaa ol fudhateera. Namicha tokkicha kana dabarsaa kennaa; anis magaalaa kana gad dhiisee nan baʼa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Dubartiin sunis Yooʼaabiin, “Mataan namicha sanaa dallaa irraan gad siif darbatama” jette.<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ergasii dubartiin sun gorsa ishee kan ogummaan guutame sanaan namoota hunda bira dhaqxe; isaanis mataa Shebaa ilma Biikrii sanaa kutanii Yooʼaabiif gad darbatan. Kanaafuu inni malakata afuufe; namoonni isaa magaalattii dhiisanii tokkoon tokkoon namaa mana ofii isaatti gale. Yooʼaab immoo gara Yerusaalem mooticha biratti deebiʼe.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yooʼaab loltoota Israaʼel hunda irratti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:23">Benaayaa ilmi Yehooyaadaa immoo Kereetotaa fi Pheletota irratti ajajaa taʼe;<verse eid="2SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adooraam namoota hojii humnaa hojjetan irratti muudame;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:24">Yehooshaafaax ilmi Ahiiluud immoo galmeessaa taʼe;<verse eid="2SA 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shewwaan barreessaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:25">Zaadoqii fi Abiyaataar immoo luboota turan;<verse eid="2SA 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />akkasumas Iiraas namichi gosa Yaaʼiri sun luba Daawud ture.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Haaloo Baafachuu Gibeʼoonotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Jabana Daawud keessa beelli waggaa sadii walitti aansee buʼe; kanaafuu Daawud fuula Rabbii Allaah barbaade. Rabbii Allaahanis, “Sababii Saaʼol Gibeʼoonota ajjeeseef isaa fi mana isaa irra yakka dhiigaatu jira” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Mootichis Gibeʼoonota walitti qabee isaan wajjin haasaʼe. Gibeʼoononni hambaa Amoorotaa turan malee ilmaan Israaʼelootaa miti; Israaʼeloonni akka isaan eegan kakuu seenaniif; Saaʼol garuu hinaaffaa Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaaf qabuun Gibeʼoonota balleessuu barbaadee ture. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daawudis, “Ani maalin isiniif godha? Akka isin dhaala Rabbii Allaah eebbiftaniif ani akkamittin araara buusuu dandaʼa?” jedhee Gibeʼoonota gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Gibeʼoononni immoo, “Nu Saaʼol irraa meetii yookaan warqee gaafachuuf mirga hin qabnu; yookaan akka namni tokko iyyuu Israaʼel keessatti duʼu gochuuf nu mirga qabnaa?” jedhanii deebisaniif.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Daawudis, “Akka ani maal isiniif godhu barbaaddu?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Isaanis akkana jedhanii mootichaaf deebii kennan; “Nama akka nu diigamnuu fi akka nu Israaʼel keessattis iddoo tokko illee hin arganne nu godhe sana, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />sanyii isaa keessaa dhiirri torba nuuf haa kennaman; nus dhaqnee biyya Saaʼol namicha Rabbii Allaahan filate sanaa, Gibeʼaatti fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti isaan fannifnaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Kanaafuu mootichi, “Tole isiniifin kenna” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Mootichi garuu sababii kakuu Rabbii Allaah kan Daawudii fi Yoonaataan ilma Saaʼol gidduutti godhame sanaatiif jedhee Mefiibooshet ilma Yoonaataan ilma Saaʼol duʼa jalaa baase. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Mootichis Armoonii fi Mefiibooshet ilmaan Riixiphaan intalli Ayyaa Saaʼoliif deesse lamaanii fi ilmaan Meerob intalli Saaʼol Adriiʼeel ilma Barzilaay namicha gosa Mehoolaatiif deesse shanan geesse. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Innis dabarsee Gibeʼoonotatti isaan kenne. Jarris isaan ajjeesanii gaara gubbaatti fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti isaan fannisan. Torbaan isaanii iyyuu walumaan dhuman; isaanis akkuma garbuun haamamuu jalqabeen yeroo midhaan haamamutti guyyoota jalqabaatti ajjeefaman.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Riixiphaan intalli Ayyaa sun wayyaa gaddaa fudhattee kattaa irra afatte. Isheenis yeroo midhaan itti haamamuu jalqabdee hamma bokkaan reeffa jara ajjeefamanii sanatti shamaayʼuniidhaa roobutti akka guyyaa guyyaa allaattiin shamaayʼun halkan immoo bineensonni bosonaa reeffa sana tuqan hin eeyyamne. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Wanni Riixiphaan intalli Ayyaa saajjatoon Saaʼol sun hojjette Daawuditti himame; <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />innis dhaqee lafee Saaʼolii fi lafee ilma isaa Yoonaataan namoota Yaabeesh Giliʼaad biraa fide. Isaan oobdii Beet Shaan iddoo Filisxeemonni gaafa Gilboʼaatti Saaʼolin ajjeesan itti jara fannisan sanaa isaan hatanii turaniitii. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Daawudis lafee Saaʼolii fi lafee Yoonaataan ilma Saaʼol achii fide; lafeen warra ajjeefamanii fannifamaniis walitti qabame.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Isaanis lafee Saaʼolii fi lafee ilma isaa Yoonaataan biyya Biniyaam keessatti, iddoo Zeelaa jedhamutti qabrii Qiish abbaa Saaʼol keessatti qabbaranii waan mootichi ajaje hunda godhan. Sana booddee Allaahan duʼaa waaʼee biyyattiif dhiʼaate ni dhagaʼe.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waraana Filisxeemotatti Baname</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">21:15‑22</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1Sn 20:4‑8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Ammas Filisxeemotaa fi Israaʼel gidduutti waraanni ni kaʼe. Daawudis namoota isaa wajjin Filisxeemota waraanuuf duule; innis akka malee dadhabe. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Namichi gosa Raafaa kan Yishbii-Benoob jedhamu tokko eeboo naasii kan kiiloo giraamii sadii fi walakkaa ulfaatuu fi goraadee haaraa hidhatee ture; innis Daawudin ajjeesuu barbaade. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Abiishaayi ilmi Zeruuyaa garuu Daawudin baraaruu dhufe; namicha Filisxeem sanas dhaʼee ajjeese. Namoonni Daawudis, “Akka ibsaan Israaʼel hin dhaamneef ati siʼachi nu wajjin waraana hin dhaqxu” jedhanii kakataniif.<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ergasii immoo lafa Goob jedhamutti Filisxeemota wajjin waraanni biraa kaʼe. Yeroo sanattis Siibekaay namichi biyya Hushaa namicha Saaf jedhamu tokko sanyii Raafaa keessaa ajjeese.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Waraana biraa kan Filisxeemota wajjin Goobitti godhame keessatti immoo Elhaanaan ilmi Yaʼiree Oregiim namichi biyya Beetlihem Gooliyaad namicha Gitii kan somaan eeboo isaa loosaa wayya dhooftuu gaʼu sana ni ajjeese.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Ammas waraana Gaatitti godhame kan biraa keessatti namicha hamma wayii gaʼu kan tokkoo tokkoo harka isaa irraa quboota jaʼa jaʼa akkasumas tokkoo tokkoo miilla isaa irraa quboota jaʼa jaʼa walumatti quboota digdamii afur qabu tokkotu ture; innis sanyii Raafaa keessaa dhalate. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Yommuu inni Israaʼelin tuttuqettis, Yoonaataan ilmi Shimeʼii obboleessi Daawud isa ajjeese.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Jarri afran kunneen sanyiiwwan Raafaa warra Gaati keessa turanii dha. Isaanis harka Daawudii fi harka namoota isaatiin dhuman.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Faarfannaa Galataa Kan Daawud</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">22:1‑51</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 18:1-50">Zab 18:1‑50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daawud yommuu Rabbii Allaahan harka diinota isaa hundaa fi harka Saaʼol jalaa isa baasetti dubbii Faarfannaa kana Rabbii Allaahaf faarfate. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Innis akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“Rabbii Allaahan kattaa koo ti; daʼannoo kootii fi oolchaa koo ti;<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Allaahan koo kattaa koo kan ani kooluu itti galuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">inni gaachana kootii fi gaanfa fayyina koo ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Inni daʼannoo koo cimaa, kooluu kootii fi fayyisaa koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ati namoota humnaan namatti kaʼan jalaas na baasta.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />“Ani Rabbii Allaah galanni isaaf malu sana nan waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">diinota koo jalaas nan baraarama.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Dambaliin duʼaa na marseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">lolaan badiisaas na liqimseera.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Funyoon siiʼool natti marame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">kiyyoon duʼaas natti dhufe.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />“Ani dhiphina koo keessatti Rabbii Allaah nan waammadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Allaah kootti nan iyyadhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Innis mana qulqullummaa isaatii sagalee koo dhagaʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">iyyi koos gurra isaa seene.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Lafti ni hollatte; ni sochootes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">hundeewwan shamaayʼuniiwwanii ni raafaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">sababii inni dheekkameefis isaan ni hollatan.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Aarri funyaan isaatii ol baʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">ibiddi waa barbadeessu afaan isaatii baʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">cileen bobaʼus afaan isaatii baʼe.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Inni shamaayʼuniiwwan tarsaasee gad buʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">duumessoonni gurraachis miilla isaa jala turan.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Inni kiirubeelin yaabbatee barrise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">qoochoo qilleensaatiinis ol baʼe.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Inni dukkana, duumessa shamaayʼun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">kan bokkaadhaan dukkanaaʼe immoo godoo isaa godhate.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Ifa fuula isaa keessaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">bakakkaan balaqqisee baʼe.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Rabbii Allaahan shamaayʼuniidhaa ni qaqawweessaʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">sagaleen Allaah Waan Hundaa Oliis ni dhagaʼame.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Inni xiyya isaa darbatee diinota bittinneesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">bakakkaas gad dhiisee isaan fixe.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Dheekkamsa, Rabbii Allaahatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">humna hafuura funyaan isaatii baʼuutiinis</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">sululawwan galaanaa ifatti baafaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">hundeewwan lafaas qullaa hafan.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Inni ol gubbaadhaa gad hiixatee na qabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">bishaanota gad fagoo keessaas na baase.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Inni diina koo isa jabaa jalaa, amajaajota koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">warra akka malee natti ciman jalaas na baase.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Isaan guyyaa rakkina kootti natti dhufan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">Rabbii Allaahan garuu gargaarsa koo ture.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Inni iddoo balʼaatti na baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">waan natti gammadeefis na oolche.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“Rabbii Allaahan akkuma qajeelummaa kootiitti naa kenneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">akkuma qulqullina harka koottis na badhaase.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Ani karaa Rabbii Allaah eegeeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">Allaah koo irraa garagalee hammina hin hojjenne.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Seerri isaa hundinuu fuula koo dura jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">anis ajaja isaa irraa hin jalʼanne.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ani fuula isaa duratti mudaa hin qabu ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">cubbuu irraas of eeggadheera.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Rabbii Allaahan akkuma qajeelumma kootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">akkuma ani fuula isaa duratti qulqulluu taʼettis na badhaaseera.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Ati nama amanamaatti amanamummaa kee argisiifta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">nama mudaa hin qabnettis kan mudaa hin qabne taata;<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />nama qulqulluutti qulqulluu taata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">nama jalʼaatti immoo jalʼaa taata.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Ati warra gad of qaban ni oolchita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">warra of tuulan immoo gad deebisuuf iji kee isaan ilaala.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Rabbii Allaah, ati ibsaa koo ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">Rabbii Allaahan dukkana koo ifatti ni geeddara.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Ani gargaarsa keetiin loltoota dhiibbadhee nan deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">Allaah kootiinis dallaa utaaluu nan dandaʼa.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Allaah kana, karaan isaa mudaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">dubbiin Rabbii Allaah hirʼina hin qabu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Warra isatti kooluu galan hundaaf inni gaachana taʼa.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Rabbii Allaah malee Allaahan eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Allaah keenya malees Kattaan eenyu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Kan humna na hidhachiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">kan akka karaan koos nagaa taʼu godhu Allaaha.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Inni miilla koo akka miilla borofaa godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">iddoo ol dheeraa irras na dhaabachiisa.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Inni harka koo waraanaaf leenjisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">irreen koos iddaa naasii dabsuu ni dandaʼa.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Ati gargaarsa kee kan nama fayyisu gaachana naaf goota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">gargaarsi kees nama guddaa na godhe.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Akka koomeen koo hin mucucaanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">miilla kootiif daandii balʼifteerta.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Ani diinota koo ariʼee nan balleesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">hamma isaan barbadaaʼanittis ani duubatti hin deebine.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Ani guutumaan guutuutti isaan nan barbadeesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">isaan deebiʼanii kaʼuu hin dandaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">isaanis miilla koo jalatti ni kufan.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Ati lolaaf humna na hidhachiifte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">amajaajota koos fuula koo duratti gad deebifte.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Akka diinonni koo dugda duubatti deebiʼanii baqatan gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">anis amajaajota koo barbadeesseera.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Isaan gargaarsaaf iyyan; garuu kan isaan oolchu tokko iyyuu hin turre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">gara Rabbii Allaahattis ni iyyatan; inni garuu deebii hin kennineef.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Anis akkuma awwaara lafaatti isaan nan daake;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">bulleessees akkuma dhoqqee daandii irraatti isaan dhidhiite.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Ati lola namootaa jalaa na baafteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">mataa sabootaa gootee na jiraachifteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Sabni ani hin beekne na tajaajila;<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />namoonni ormaa na sossobatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">isaan akkuma waaʼee koo dhagaʼaniin naaf ajajaman.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Isaan hundi abdii kutatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">hollachaas daʼannoo isaanii jabaa keessaa baʼan.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“Rabbii Allaahan jiraataa dha! Kattaan koo haa eebbifamu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Allaahan koo, Kattaan, Fayyisaan koo ol ol haa jedhu!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Inni Allaah haaloo naa baasu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">kan sabootas na jala galchu,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />kan diinota koo jalaas bilisa na baasuu dha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Ati amajaajota kootii ol na goota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">gooltota jalaas na baafte.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Kanaafuu yaa Rabbii Allaah, ani saboota gidduutti sin leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">zabuurii galataa illee maqaa keetiif nan faarfadha.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />“Inni moʼannaawwan gurguddaa mootii isaatiif ni kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">dibamaa isaa Daawudii fi sanyii isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">araara bara baraa ni argisiisa.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dubbii Daawud Kan Dhumaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Dubbiin Daawud dhuma irratti dubbate kanaa dha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Himanni Daawud ilmi Isseey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">himanni nama Allaahan Waan Hundaa Olii, ol ol isa qabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">nama Allaahan Yaaʼikuub isa dibe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">faarfataan Israaʼel jaallatamaan sun akkana jedhe:<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Hafuurri Rabbii Allaah karaa kootiin dubbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">dubbiin isaas arraba koo irra ture.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Allaahan Israaʼel dubbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Kattaan Israaʼel akkana naan jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Namni qajeelummaan saba bulchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">kan sodaa Allaahatiin bulchu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />inni akka ifa biiftuu ganamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">kan iddoo duumessi hin jirretti baʼuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">akkuma ifa aduu kan erga bokkaan caamee booddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">marga biqilchuu ti.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Manni koo Allaah duratti qajeelaa mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Inni kakuu bara baraa na wajjin seenee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">isas qajeelchee karaa hundaan ni eega mitii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Isatu fayyina koo fiixaan baasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">fedhii koo hundas naaf guuta mitii?<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Namoonni hamoon hundinuu garuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">akkuma qoraattii harkaan walitti hin qabamneetti gatamu.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Namni qoraattii tuqu kam iyyuu miʼa sibiilaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">yookaan somaa eeboo qabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">qoraattiin sunis lafuma jirutti gubama.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Namoota Daawud Jajjaboo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">23:8‑39</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1Sn 11:10‑41</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Maqaan namoota Daawud warra jajjaboo kanaa dha:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Yosheeb-Bashebet namichi Tahikmooni hoogganaa sadanii ture; innis lola tokko irratti eeboo mirmirsee namoota dhibba saddeet fixe.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Kan isatti aanu immoo Eleʼaazaar ilma Doodoo namicha gosa Ahooʼaa ture; innis yeroo Filisxeemota lolaaf achitti walitti qabamanii turan sana waraanuuf kutatanitti, namoota jajjaboo Daawud wajjin turan sadan keessaa tokko ture. Ergasii namoonni Israaʼel booddeetti deebiʼan; <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />inni garuu utuu lafa dhaabatee turee hin sochoʼin hamma harki isaa dadhabee goraadee isaatti gogutti Filisxeemota ni rukute. Rabbii Allaahan gaafas moʼannoo guddaa kenne. Loltoonnis warra duʼan irraa hiikachuu qofaaf gara Eleʼaazaaritti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Isatti aanees Saamaa ilma Aagee namicha gosa Haraaraatu ture. Yommuu Filisxeemonni iddoo Leehi jedhamutti lafa qotiisaa kan misiraan guutame tokko biratti walitti qabamanitti loltoonni Israaʼel isaan duraa baqatan. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Saamaan garuu lafa qotiisaa walakkaatti iddoo qabatee ture. Innis irraa ittisuudhaan Filisxeemota fixe; Rabbii Allaahanis moʼannaa guddaa kenne.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Yeroo midhaan haammamutti utuu loltoonni Filisxeemotaa Sulula Refaayim keessatti walitti qabamanii jiranuu, hangafoota soddomman sana keessaa namoonni sadii gara holqa Adulaamitti gara Daawud gad buʼan. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Yeroo sanatti Daawud daʼannoo cimaa keessa ture; loltoonni Filisxeem immoo Beetlihem turan. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daawudis Dheebotee, “Utuu namni tokko boolla bishaanii kan karra Beetlihem bira jiru keessaa bishaan dhugaatii naa fidee hoo!” jedhe. <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Kanaafuu namoonni jajjaboon sadan sun qubata Filisxeemotaa keessaan darbanii boolla bishaanii kan karra Beetlihem bira jiru keessaa bishaan waraabanii Daawudiif fidan. Inni garuu dhuguu ni dide; qooda kanaa bishaan sana fuula Rabbii Allaah duratti dhangalaase. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Innis, “Yaa Rabbii Allaaha, waan kana gochuun narraa haa fagaatu! Bishaan kun dhiiga namoota lubbuu ofii isaaniitti kutatanii deemanii mitii?” jedhe. Kanaafuu Daawud bishaan sana hin dhugne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Egaa wanni namoonni jajjaboon sadan sun hojjetan kana ture.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abiishaayi ilmi Zeruuyaa obboleessi Yooʼaab hoogganaa sadan isaanii ture. Innis namoota dhibba sadiitti eeboo isaa ol kaafatee isaan fixe; akkasiin innis akkuma namoota sadan sanaa beekamaa taʼe. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Abiishaayin warra sadan caalaa ulfina hin argannee ree? Inni yoo isaan keessaa tokko taʼuu baate iyyuu ajajaa isaanii taʼe.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaayaa ilmi Yehooyaadaa loltuun cimaan biyya Qabziʼeel sunis loltuu moʼannaa gurguddaa argamsiise ture. Innis loltoota Moʼaab kanneen akka malee jajjaboo taʼan lama ajjeese. Gaafa cabbiin roobe tokkos boolla keessa seenee leenca ajjeese. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Inni namicha biyya Gibxi guddicha tokko illee ni ajjeese. Namichi Gibxi sun eeboo harkaa qabaatu iyyuu Benaayaa bokkuudhaan isatti baʼe; innis harka namicha Gibxi sanaatii eeboo butatee eeboodhuma isaatiin isa ajjeese. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Hojiiwwan gootummaa kanneen Benaayaa ilmi Yehooyaadaa hojjete kana faʼi; innis akkuma namoota jajjaboo sadan sanaa nama beekamaa ture. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Inni namoota soddomman sana keessaa nama kam iyyuu caalaa ulfina guddaa argate; garuu namoota Sadan sanatti hin dabalamne. Daawudis ajajaa eegdota ofii isaa isa godhate.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Jara soddomman sana keessattis:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:24" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asaaheel obboleessa Yooʼaab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Elhaanaan ilma Doodoo namicha Beetlihem,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shamaa namicha gosa Haroodaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">Eliiqaa namicha gosa Haroodaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Heleez namicha Phaaltii,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">Iiraa ilma Iqeesh nama Teqooʼaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiiʼezer nama Anaatoot,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Mebunaay nama biyya Hushaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Zalmoon nama Ahooʼaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharaayi nama Netoofaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Heeled ilma Baʼanaa nama Netoofaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">gosa Biniyaam keessaa Iitaayi ilma Riibaay namicha Gibeʼaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaayaa nama Phiraatoon</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">Hidaay namicha sululoota Gaʼaash,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abii-Alboon namicha biyya Arbaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">Azmaawet nama Barhuum,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliiyaabaa namicha Shaʼalboon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">ilmaan Yaasheen,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Yoonaataan, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />ilma Shamaa namicha Haraaraa sanaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">Ahiiʼaam ilma Shaaraar namicha Aroodaa sanaa,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Eliiphelexi ilma Ahasbaayi nama Maʼakaat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">Eliʼaam ilma Ahiitofel nama Giiloon,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hezroo nama Qarmeloos,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">Faʼaraay nama biyya Arbii,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Yigiʼaal ilma Naataan namicha Zoobaa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">Baanii gosa Gaad,<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Zeleq namicha gosa Amoon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Nahaaraay namicha gosa Biʼeeroot kan Yooʼaab ilma Zeruuyaatiif miʼa lolaa baatu sana ture;<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Iiraas namicha gosa Yitraa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:38">Gaareeb namicha gosa Yitraa,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />akkasumas Uuriyaa namicha Heet.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39" />
  <para style="lf" vid="2SA 23:39">Walumatti namoota soddomii torba turan.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Daawud Loltoota Lakkaaʼe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 24:1-17">24:1‑17</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 21:1-17">1Sn 21:1‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Aariin Rabbii Allaah ammas Israaʼelitti kaʼee Daawudiin, “Dhaqiitii Israaʼelii fi Yihuudaa lakkaaʼi” jedhee isaanitti kakaase.<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Kanaafuu mootichi Yooʼaabii fi ajajjoota waraanaa kanneen isa bira turaniin, “Akka ani akka isaan hammam akka baayʼatan beekuu dandaʼuuf gosoota Israaʼel kanneen Daanii hamma Bersheebaatti jiraatan hunda keessa deemaatii namoota loluu dandaʼan galmeessaa” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Yooʼaab garuu deebisee, “Rabbii Allaahan kee loltoota kee dachaa dhibba caalaa haa baayʼisu; iji gooftaa koo mootichaas waan kana haa argu. Garuu gooftaan koo mootichi maaliif waan kana gochuu barbaade?” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Taʼus dubbiin mootichaa Yooʼaabii fi ajajjoota loltootaa yaada geeddarachiise; kanaafuu isaan fuula mootichaa duraa baʼanii namoota Israaʼel kanneen loluu dandaʼan galmeessuu deeman.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Isaanis erga Yordaanos ceʼanii booddee gara kibba magaalaa sulula keessatti argamuutiin Aroʼeer bira qubatan; achii immoo Gaad keessa darbanii Yaʼizeeritti qajeelan. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Isaanis gara Giliʼaadii fi Tabaason Adasaay, itti aansanii gara Daan yaaʼanii achii immoo naannaʼanii Siidoonaa dhaqan. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Ergasii immoo gara Daʼannoo Xiiroos, gara magaalaawwan Hiiwotaatii fi Kanaʼaanotaa hundaa dhaqan. Dhuma irratti immoo gara Bersheebaa kan kibba Yihuudaatti argamtu sanaa dhaqan.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Isaanis erga guutummaa biyyattii keessa naannaʼanii booddee jiʼa sagalii fi bultii digdamaatti Yerusaalemitti deebiʼan.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yooʼaabis lakkoobsa namoota loluu dandaʼanii mootichatti hime; Israaʼel keessa namoota lolaaf gaʼumsa qaban kanneen goraadee qabachuu dandaʼan kuma dhibba saddeeti, Yihuudaa keessa immoo namoota kuma dhibba shanitu ture.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Daawud waan erga loltoota lakkaaʼee booddee balleessaan itti dhagaʼameef Rabbii Allaahan, “Ani waan hojjedhe keessatti cubbuu guddaa hojjedheera. Rabbii Allaah, ani akka ati balleessaa garbicha keetii dhiiftuuf sin kadhadha. Ani hojii gowwummaa guddaa hojjedheeraa” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Guyyaa itti aanutti utuu Daawud hirribaa hin kaʼin ergaan Rabbii Allaah gara waa himaa Daawud gara Gaad nabiiʼiyyichaa dhufe; ergaan sunis, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Dhaqiitii Daawudiin, ‘Rabbii Allaahan akkana siin jedha: Ani filannoo sadii siifin kenna; akka ani isa sitti fiduuf isaan keessaa tokko filadhu’ jedhi” jedha.<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Kanaafuu Gaad gara Daawud dhaqee, “Waggaa torba biyya kee irra beelli haa buʼuu? Yookaan diinonni kee jiʼa sadiif si haa ariʼanii? Yookaan dhaʼichi guyyaa sadii biyya kee haa dhaʼuu? Egaa amma itti yaadiitii waan ani isa na erge sanaaf deebisu murteessi” jedheen.<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daawud immoo Gaadiin, “Ani akka malee dhiphadheera. Waan araarri isaa guddaa taʼeef nu harka Rabbii Allaah haa seennu; garuu akka ani harka namaa seenu hin godhin” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Kanaafuu Rabbii Allaahan guyyaa itti aanu ganamaa jalqabee hamma guyyaan murtaaʼe raawwatutti Israaʼelitti dhaʼicha fide; Daanii hamma Bersheebaatti namoonni kumni torbaatamni ni dhuman. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Yeroo malaʼikkaan Allaah Yerusaalemin balleessuuf harka isaa diriirfatetti Rabbii Allaahan sababii hubaatiin sun isa gaddisiiseef malaʼikkaa isaa kan saba balleessuuf ture sanaan, “Ni gaʼa! Harka kee deebifadhu” jedhe. Yeroo sana malaʼikkaan Rabbii Allaah oobdii Arawunaa namicha gosa Yebuus sanaa bira ture.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daawud yommuu malaʼikkaa namoota ajjeesaa ture sana argetti, Rabbii Allaahan, “Namni cubbuu fi balleessaa hojjete anuma. Isaan kunneen garuu hoolotaa dha. Isaan maal godhan? Harki kee anaa fi maatii koo irra haa buʼu” jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawud Iddoo aarsaa Tolche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 24:18-25">24:18‑25</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 21:18-26">1Sn 21:18‑26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Gaafas Gaad gara Daawud dhaqee, “Ol baʼiitii oobdii Arawunaa namicha gosa Yebuus sanaa keessatti iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaahaf ijaari” jedheen. <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Kanaafuu Daawud akkuma Rabbii Allaahan karaa Gaadiin isa ajajetti ol baʼe. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arawunaan yommuu milʼatee mootichaa fi namoota isaa kanneen gara isaa dhufaa jiran argetti, gad baʼee fuula mootichaa duratti addaan lafatti gombifamee sagade.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Arawunaanis, “Gooftaan koo mootichi maaliif gara garbicha isaa dhufe?” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daawud immoo, “Ani akka dhaʼichi saba irra buʼe kun dhaabatuuf, oobdii kee bitee isa irratti iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaahaf tolchuufin dhufe” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arawunaanis Daawudiin akkana jedhe; “Gooftaan koo mootichi waan isatti tolu kam iyyuu fudhatee haa dhiʼeessu. Aarsaa gubamuuf sangoonni kunoo ti; qoraaniif immoo miʼi ittiin midhaan dhaʼamuu fi waanjoon sangaa as jira. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Yaa mootii, Arawunaan waan kana hunda mootichaaf ni kenna.” Akkasumas Arawunaan, “Rabbii Allaahan kee siif haa fudhatu” isaan jedhe.<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Mootichi garuu, “Akkas miti; ani gatiidhaan sirraa bituu na barbaachisa. Ani waan gatii itti hin baasin Rabbii Allaah kootiif aarsaa gubamu godhee hin dhiʼeessu” jedhee Arawunaaf deebise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Kanaafuu Daawud oobdichaa fi sangoota sana meetii saqilii shantamaan bite. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Daawudis achitti iddoo aarsaa Rabbii Allaahaf tolchee aarsaa gubamuu fi aarsaa nagaa dhiʼeesse. Rabbii Allaahanis duʼaa waaʼee biyyattiif dhiʼaateef deebii kenne; dhaʼichis Israaʼel irraa ni deebiʼe.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>